17528>>>>>>>>>>>    // NavigateData - see tWebNavigateData
17528>>>>>>>>>>>    //
17528>>>>>>>>>>>    // See also GetNavigateBackData
17528>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnGetNavigateBackData tWebNavigateData ByRef NavigateData Handle hoBackToView
17530>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
17531>>>>>>>>>>>        
17531>>>>>>>>>>>        
17531>>>>>>>>>>>    // Event fired before a view is shown via the view stack Navigate API
17531>>>>>>>>>>>    // when adding a new view to the stack. 
17531>>>>>>>>>>>    // Intended as a hook for developers who need to perform special
17531>>>>>>>>>>>    // preparation of the NavigateData struct that is passed to the new view.
17531>>>>>>>>>>>    //
17531>>>>>>>>>>>    // NavigateData - see tWebNavigateData
17531>>>>>>>>>>>    //
17531>>>>>>>>>>>    // See also GetNavigateForwardData
17531>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnGetNavigateForwardData tWebNavigateData ByRef NavigateData Handle hoToView
17533>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
17534>>>>>>>>>>>
17534>>>>>>>>>>>    // event fired by a navigate back event. This sent to the invoking object of
17534>>>>>>>>>>>    // the view being navigated back to. This is only sent when this is one level back.
17534>>>>>>>>>>>    // It can be used to customize a navigateback update. 
17534>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnNavigateBack Handle hoCallback tWebNavigateData NavigateData   
17536>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
17537>>>>>>>>>>>    
17537>>>>>>>>>>>    // Called at the end of a webapp client call. An object must be registered
17537>>>>>>>>>>>    // before this event can be triggered. This can be done with:
17537>>>>>>>>>>>    // Delegate Send RegisterOnCallEndEvent
17537>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnCallEnd
17539>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
17540>>>>>>>>>>>    
17540>>>>>>>>>>>    // Performs the navigation operation defined using WebRegisterPath for this object. Results in
17540>>>>>>>>>>>    // an error if no or multiple navigation paths are defined.
17540>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure NavigatePath
17542>>>>>>>>>>>        Send PerformNavigateByInvokingObj Self
17543>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
17544>>>>>>>>>>>    
17544>>>>>>>>>>>    // Attempts to find the info that is being used in navigation.
17544>>>>>>>>>>>    // The byref is filled with te requested information, and True is returned.
17544>>>>>>>>>>>    // If no info is found, false is returned.
17544>>>>>>>>>>>    Function NavigateInfo Returns tWebForwardPath[]
17546>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebForwardPath[] aNavInfo
17546>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebForwardPath[] aNavInfo
17547>>>>>>>>>>>        Send PerformRetrieveNavigateInfo Self (&aNavInfo)
17548>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return aNavInfo
17549>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
17550>>>>>>>>>>>
17550>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Called to confirm if a server action is allowed on this web object. Set bAllow to false to block an action.
17550>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure AllowServerAction Boolean ByRef bAllow String sMethodName Handle hoMessage Boolean bIsFunction
17552>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
17553>>>>>>>>>>>
17553>>>>>>>>>>>    // Returns the object handle of the first child web control with a data binding
17553>>>>>>>>>>>    // matching the passed Table.column (file & field). 
17553>>>>>>>>>>>    //
17553>>>>>>>>>>>    // This is a Recursive Function, you call it the first time passing the object 
17553>>>>>>>>>>>    // handle of a cWebView (or other window) as hoParent. It will recursively
17553>>>>>>>>>>>    // search the children of the view. It is assumed the view itself is not the
17553>>>>>>>>>>>    // object we are looking for.
17553>>>>>>>>>>>    //
17553>>>>>>>>>>>    // hoParent - Is the view containing the cWebControl objects to be searched.
17553>>>>>>>>>>>    // iFile  - Is the data binding table number we are looking for.
17553>>>>>>>>>>>    // iField - Is the data binding column we are looking for.
17553>>>>>>>>>>>    // Returns - The object handle of the first matching child web control.
17553>>>>>>>>>>>    Function FirstControlWithDataBinding Integer iFile Integer iField Returns Handle
17555>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iTestFile iTestField
17555>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer i icWebObject
17555>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bDataBindable
17555>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoTarget
17555>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle[] aChildWebControls
17556>>>>>>>>>>>        
17556>>>>>>>>>>>        // Iterate and test the parent's children....
17556>>>>>>>>>>>        Get paChildWebControls to aChildWebControls
17557>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(aChildWebControls)) to icWebObject
17558>>>>>>>>>>>        
17558>>>>>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to (icWebObject - 1)
17564>>>>>>>>>>>>
17564>>>>>>>>>>>            Get pbDataBindable of aChildWebControls[i] to bDataBindable
17565>>>>>>>>>>>            
17565>>>>>>>>>>>            If (bDataBindable) Begin
