18936>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function DelegateDeoRequest Returns Boolean
18938>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer hoServerDEO
18938>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get ServerDEO to hoServerDEO
18939>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (hoServerDEO<>0 and hoServerDEO<>Self)
18940>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
