20098>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // required DD/DEO interface. This is sent from the DD during a save Request_Validate is used to allow
20098>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // fields with DEOs bound to them to do the first validation.  
20098>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function Validate_Items Boolean bNotFindReq Returns Integer
20100>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bOk
20100>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoOrigin 
20100>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iMode
20100>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // DoAutoFind may do a DD find and reset these modes. Make sure the get restored
20100>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move OPERATION_MODE to iMode
20101>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move OPERATION_ORIGIN to hoOrigin
20102>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send DoAutoFind // we must make sure autofind happens before the validation
20103>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move iMode to OPERATION_MODE
20104>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move hoOrigin to OPERATION_ORIGIN
20105>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get OnValidate to bOk
20106>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (not(bOk))
20107>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
