20108>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // performs a clear of the DD that owns the Data_File. This can be used to clear a parent
20108>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // field in a view (e.g., salesperson in order view). This is not assigned a hot key by
20108>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // default and it is up to the developer to use this. We also use this with autofinds that
20108>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // allow null parents. Also note that there are no data-loss messages sent for this message
20108>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Added as part of null parent support.
20108>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Request_ClearBindingTable
20110>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
20110>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile
20110>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
20111>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File to iFile
20112>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoServer and iFile) Begin
20114>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send ClearForTable of hoServer iFile
20115>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20115>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20115>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
