20195>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure End_Construct_Object
20197>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send End_Construct_Object
20199>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20199>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebPublishFunction OnValidate
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebPublishProcedure OnChange
20201>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebPublishProcedure OnAutoFind
20202>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
20203>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>End_Class
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>Use cWebObjectOwner_mixin.pkg
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>// cWebRadio objects act in a co-ordinated way with other radio button objects as a collective "group"
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>// 1 or more groups of radio buttons can live together in the same container object.
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>// In a radio button group there is always one button object that is the "master" and the "slaves" in that group
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>// are connected to it. Which radio button is the master should be irrelevant to the developer.
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>// 
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>// The psValue property of every radio button in a group is synchronized.
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>// A group is defined by creating a master radio button and connecting slave buttons to it. Any button can be
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>// the master. The master button defines a group name and\or a data binding. The Data Binding and group name
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>// is copied to each slave.
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>// 
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>// A slave can be connected to a master button by...
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>// a) Setting the slave's phoMasterRadio property to the master's object handle.
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>// b) Seting the slave's psGroupName to the same group name as the master radio button.
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>// A radio button cannot change radio groups dynamically. Radio groups are configured at design time and connected
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>// at object creation time. Once established, a radio group should not be changed.
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>// An empty\null psGroupName is allowed. A null group name will be converted into the object name of the radio's
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>// container web panel object. All radio buttons with a null psGroupName in the same Web Panel belong to the same group.
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Setting a radio button's data binding automatically set's its group name to "table_name.column_name".
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Groups are scoped to their view (or dialog). Button objects of the same group can be defined anywhere within
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>// the same view. Buttons in one view cannot be grouped to buttons of another view.
20204>>>>>>>>>>>>>Class cWebRadio is a cWebBaseDEO    
20205>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Construct_Object:
20205>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20205>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
20209>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20209>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psMasterRadio            // Name of the master radio button in this group (can be self). This is either advanced or private interface.
20212>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20212>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Handle phoMasterRadio 0         // Object handle to the master radio button in this group (can be self). This is either advanced or private interface.
20213>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20213>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Published Properties....
20213>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psMasterName ""
20216>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psGroupName ""           // All radio buttons in a view with this group name belong to the same radio button group
20219>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psRadioValue ""          // This is the unique value for this radio button in its group. When the group's psValue matches psRadioValue then this radio button is selected.  
20222>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbServerOnSelect False  // Determines is the client will initiate an OnSelect event to the server when this radio button is selected.
20225>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psClientOnSelect ""      // Client event listner to fire for when this radio object is selected.
20228>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20228>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psCaption ""
20231>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20231>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set pbShowLabel to False
20232>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set psJSClass to "df.WebRadio"
20233>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
