20266>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get psDynamicObjectId to sDynamicObjectId
20267>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
20267>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get FindRadioGroup sDynamicObjectId (&bFound) to tRadioGroup
20268>>>>>>>>>>>>>
