20434>>>>>>>>>    Function AllowAccess Returns Boolean
20436>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bOk bEnforced
20436>>>>>>>>>        // User hook that is called by the session manager if a call comes in that tries to access 
20436>>>>>>>>>        // this view. Can be used to implement a custom access rights checks for this view.
20436>>>>>>>>>        
20436>>>>>>>>>        // first check with webapp to see if a login is required and we are logged in
20436>>>>>>>>>        // pbLoginModeEnforced can cancel this check, which might be needed with things like login dialogs
20436>>>>>>>>>        Move True to bOk
20437>>>>>>>>>        Get pbLoginModeEnforced to bEnforced
20438>>>>>>>>>        If (bEnforced) Begin
20440>>>>>>>>>            Delegate Get ValidLogin to bOk
20442>>>>>>>>>        End 
20442>>>>>>>>>>
20442>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bOk
20443>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
