21198>>>>>>>>>        Move Trans                  to aTranslations[-1]
21199>>>>>>>>>        
21199>>>>>>>>>        Move "november"             to Trans.sN
21200>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$November            to Trans.sV
21201>>>>>>>>>        Move Trans                  to aTranslations[-1]
21202>>>>>>>>>        
21202>>>>>>>>>        Move "december"             to Trans.sN
