21413>>>>>>>>>        Move (BinarySearchArray(searchItem, aDDOIndex, False)) to iIndex
21414>>>>>>>>>        
21414>>>>>>>>>        If (iIndex <> -1) ;            Function_Return aDDOIndex[iIndex].hValue
21417>>>>>>>>>            
