21419>>>>>>>>>    // Returns the collection of DDO object name and RowID pairs for the view's DDO structure.
21419>>>>>>>>>    // The collection is specially ordered so that the first DDO is the view's Main DD, followed
21419>>>>>>>>>    // by the child DDO sub-tree, then the parent DDO sub-tree. This is the order that you want
21419>>>>>>>>>    // to traverse the DDO tree when synchronizing each server DDO to the client RowIDs.
21419>>>>>>>>>    Procedure StoreDDOStates
21421>>>>>>>>>        Integer i icDDO iFile
21421>>>>>>>>>        RowID riRowID
21421>>>>>>>>>        String sCheck
21421>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bDynamicConstraints
21421>>>>>>>>>        Integer iSrvr iSrvrs
21421>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServerDD
21421>>>>>>>>>        Integer iTable
21421>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bSwitched
21421>>>>>>>>>        Handle[] aDDOHandles
21422>>>>>>>>>        tWebDDODef tDDODef
21422>>>>>>>>>        tWebDDODef tDDODef
21422>>>>>>>>>        
21422>>>>>>>>>        Get IsDynamicConstraints to bDynamicConstraints
21423>>>>>>>>>        Get WebObjectName to tDDODef.sView
21424>>>>>>>>>        
21424>>>>>>>>>        Get paDDOHandlesTree to aDDOHandles
21425>>>>>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(aDDOHandles)) to icDDO
21426>>>>>>>>>        
21426>>>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to (icDDO - 1)
21432>>>>>>>>>>
21432>>>>>>>>>            Get CurrentRowId of aDDOHandles[i] to riRowID
21433>>>>>>>>>            Move (SerializeRowID(riRowID)) to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].sRowID
21434>>>>>>>>>            Get DDIdentity aDDOHandles[i] to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].sName
21435>>>>>>>>>            Get pDDDefaults of aDDOHandles[i] to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].aRemembered 
21436>>>>>>>>>            If (bDynamicConstraints) Begin
21438>>>>>>>>>                Get Constrain_File of aDDOHandles[i] to iFile
21439>>>>>>>>>            End
21439>>>>>>>>>>
21439>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
21440>>>>>>>>>                Move -1 to iFile
21441>>>>>>>>>            End
21441>>>>>>>>>>
21441>>>>>>>>>            Move iFile to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].iConstrainFile
21442>>>>>>>>>
21442>>>>>>>>>            // DD changed_state and parent changed state info
21442>>>>>>>>>            Get Changed_State of aDDOHandles[i] to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].bChanged
21443>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Server_Count of aDDOHandles[i] to iSrvrs
21444>>>>>>>>>            For iSrvr from 0 to (iSrvrs-1)
21450>>>>>>>>>>
21450>>>>>>>>>                Get Data_Set_Server of aDDOHandles[i] iSrvr to hoServerDD
21451>>>>>>>>>                Get Main_File of hoServerDD to iTable
21452>>>>>>>>>                Move iTable to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].aParentChanged[iSrvr].iTable
21453>>>>>>>>>                Get ParentDDOSwitched of aDDOHandles[i] iTable to bSwitched
21454>>>>>>>>>                Move bSwitched to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].aParentChanged[iSrvr].bSwitched 
21455>>>>>>>>>            Loop
21456>>>>>>>>>>
21456>>>>>>>>>
21456>>>>>>>>>                        
21456>>>>>>>>>        Loop
21457>>>>>>>>>>
21457>>>>>>>>>            
21457>>>>>>>>>        Move True to tDDODef.bA
21458>>>>>>>>>        
21458>>>>>>>>>        WebSet ptDDOStates to tDDODef
21459>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
