21645>>>>>>>>>            // returns the DDO tree structure Main DD, followed by child DD tree, then parent DD tree
21645>>>>>>>>>            Send FindDataDictionaries hoMain_DD (&aDDOHandles)
21646>>>>>>>>>        End
