21657>>>>>>>>>        If (icDDO > 0) Begin
21659>>>>>>>>>            Move (ResizeArray(aDDOIndex, icDDO)) to aDDOIndex
21660>>>>>>>>>            For i from 0 to (icDDO - 1)
