21736>>>>>>>>>    // Sent when a SyncDDos fails - which happens during a request resync process. 
21736>>>>>>>>>    // By default call standard OnRefindRecordError. This allows for customization
21736>>>>>>>>>    // This mainly exists for debugging purposes. There is not much you can do here because
21736>>>>>>>>>    // this is happening at a very low level. If you change this, be careful.
21736>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnSyncDDOsRefindError Handle hoDD
21738>>>>>>>>>        Send OnRefindRecordError hoDD reoSyncDDOs retUndefined
