22132>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure StateHashToUrl String ByRef sHashUrl
22134>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sBaseHref
22134>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22134>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (pbStateAsUrlHash(Self)) Begin
22136>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (Left(sHashUrl, 1) <> "#") Begin
22138>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move ("#" + sHashUrl) to sHashUrl 
22139>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
22139>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22139>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22139>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22139>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22139>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebGet psBaseHref to sBaseHref
22140>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (sBaseHref + sHashUrl) to sHashUrl
22141>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
