22204>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Used for storing non-scalar (advanced) synchronized properties during the AJAX Call. Next
22204>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// to the tWebAdvSyncProp struct known by the client it also keeps track of 
22204>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// changes and caches the deserialized value in a variant for repeative access.
22204>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Struct tWebCacheAdvProp
22204>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Handle hoObj
22204>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    tWebAdvSyncProp tSyncProp
22204>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    tWebAdvSyncProp tSyncProp
