22536>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22536>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Singleton object that is the central manager for all web properties handlers. It is accessed by
22536>>>>>>>>>>>>>// the cWebApp class when needed and WebSet and WebGet are handled here. It has forwards these 
22536>>>>>>>>>>>>>// operations to the handler objects for the different web property types. These handlers are 
22536>>>>>>>>>>>>>// created by this class and all share a generic API (cWebBasePropertyHandler). These different types 
22536>>>>>>>>>>>>>// are Client (web properties stored and used on the client), Server (web properties stored on the 
22536>>>>>>>>>>>>>// server bound to the page scope) and ServerSession (web properties stored on the server bound to 
22536>>>>>>>>>>>>>// the session lifetime).
22536>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
22536>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22536>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22536>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22536>>>>>>>>>>>>>Class cWebPropertyHost_mixin is a Mixin
22537>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Define_cWebPropertyHost_mixin
22539>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22539>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psSPKey ""                     // Web property storing the identifier key for server-side properties with a page lifetime
22542>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22542>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Initialize and store handles to the three different handlers
22542>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Handle phoClientHandler C_WebUnresolvedObject
22543>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Handle phoServerHandler C_WebUnresolvedObject
22544>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Handle phoSessionHandler C_WebUnresolvedObject
22545>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Handle phoClientProtectedHandler C_WebUnresolvedObject
22546>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22546>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send InitPropertyManager
22547>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
22548>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22548>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure InitPropertyManager
22550>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Error DFERR_PROGRAM "Not implemented"
22551>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22551>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
22552>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22552>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
22552>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Clear web properties between requests!
22552>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
22552>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Call_ClearPropertyHost
22554>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClearData of (phoClientHandler(Self))
22555>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClearData of (phoServerHandler(Self))
22556>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClearData of (phoSessionHandler(Self))
22557>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
22558>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22558>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22558>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
22558>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Central WebGet handler for non-scalar (advanced) web properties.
22558>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Forwards the request to the handler for the specific web property type (Client, Server, ServerSession).
22558>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
22558>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function OwnerGetAdvSyncProp Handle hoObject tWebPropMetaData ByRef pubProp Returns Variant
22560>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoHandler
22560>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bIsAjaxWebObject
22560>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sObject 
22560>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Variant vReturn
22560>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22560>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Test that the target object is a cWebObject....
22560>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get IsAjaxWebObject of hoObject to bIsAjaxWebObject
22561>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22561>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (not(bIsAjaxWebObject)) Begin
22563>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Object_Label of hoObject to sObject
22564>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_PROGRAM (SFormat(C_$WebAppNotWebObject, sObject, "WebGet " + pubProp.sName, C_NewLine+C_NewLine))
22565>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22565>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return
22566>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22566>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22566>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22566>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Get and call handler
22566>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get PropertyHandler hoObject pubProp.eMode to hoHandler
22567>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoHandler = -1) Begin
22569>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Object_Label of hoObject to sObject
22570>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_PROGRAM (SFormat("Property '%2' of object '%1' is not a valid web property for %3.%4Check the web property meta value.", pubProp.sName, sObject, "WebGet", C_NewLine+C_NewLine))        
22571>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22571>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return
22572>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22572>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22572>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22572>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get GetAdvSyncProp of hoHandler hoObject (&pubProp) to vReturn  
22573>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return vReturn  
22574>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
22575>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22575>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22575>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
22575>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Central WebGet handler for scalar web properties.
22575>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Forwards the request to the handler for the specific web property type (Client, Server, ServerSession).
22575>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
22575>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function OwnerGetSyncProp Handle hoObject tWebPropMetaData ByRef pubProp Returns String
22577>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoHandler
22577>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bIsAjaxWebObject
22577>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sObject sReturn
22577>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22577>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Test that the target object is a cWebObject....
22577>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get IsAjaxWebObject of hoObject to bIsAjaxWebObject
22578>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22578>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (not(bIsAjaxWebObject)) Begin
22580>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Object_Label of hoObject to sObject
22581>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_PROGRAM (SFormat(C_$WebAppNotWebObject, sObject, "WebGet " + pubProp.sName, C_NewLine+C_NewLine))
22582>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22582>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return
22583>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22583>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22583>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22583>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Get and call handler
22583>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get PropertyHandler hoObject pubProp.eMode to hoHandler
22584>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoHandler = -1) Begin
22586>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Object_Label of hoObject to sObject
22587>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_PROGRAM (SFormat("Property '%2' of object '%1' is not a valid web property for %3.%4Check the web property meta value.", pubProp.sName, sObject, "WebGet", C_NewLine+C_NewLine))        
22588>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22588>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return
22589>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22589>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22589>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22589>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get GetScalarSyncProp of hoHandler hoObject (&pubProp) to sReturn  
22590>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return sReturn  
22591>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
22592>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22592>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
22592>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Central WebSet handler.
22592>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Forwards the request to the handler of the specific web property type (Client, Server, ServerSession).
22592>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
22592>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OwnerSetSyncProp Handle hoObject tWebPropMetaData ByRef pubProp Variant vPropValue
22594>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoHandler
22594>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bIsAjaxWebObject
22594>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sObject
22594>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22594>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Object_Label of hoObject to sObject
22595>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22595>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Test that the target object is a cWebObject....
22595>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get IsAjaxWebObject of hoObject to bIsAjaxWebObject
22596>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22596>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (not(bIsAjaxWebObject)) Begin
22598>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_PROGRAM (SFormat(C_$WebAppNotWebObject, sObject, "WebSet " + pubProp.sName, C_NewLine+C_NewLine))
22599>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22599>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
22600>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22600>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22600>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22600>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Get and call handler
22600>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get PropertyHandler hoObject pubProp.eMode to hoHandler
22601>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoHandler = -1) Begin
22603>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_PROGRAM (SFormat("Property '%2' of object '%1' is not a valid web property for %3.%4Check the web property meta value.", pubProp.sName, sObject, "WebSet", C_NewLine+C_NewLine))        
22604>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22604>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
22605>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22605>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22605>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send SetSyncProp of hoHandler hoObject (&pubProp) vPropValue
22606>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure   
22607>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22607>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
22607>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Looks up the web property type based on the object handle and the index and returns the right handler.
22607>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
22607>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function PropertyHandler Handle hoObject Integer eMode Returns Handle
22609>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoHandler hoNeighborhood
22609>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle[] aHandlers
22610>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22610>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move -1 to hoHandler
22611>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22611>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (eMode = wptClient) Begin
22613>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get phoClientHandler to hoHandler    
22614>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22614>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22614>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else If (eMode = wptServerPage) Begin
22617>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get phoServerHandler to hoHandler
22618>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22618>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22618>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else If (eMode = wptServerSession) Begin
22621>>>>>>>>>>>>>            //  The server properties with page lifetime are stored per neighborhood (per view..)
22621>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get phoSessionHandler to hoHandler
22622>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22622>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22622>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else If (eMode = wptClientProtected) Begin
22625>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get phoClientProtectedHandler to hoHandler
22626>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22626>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22626>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22626>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return hoHandler
22627>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
22628>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22628>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22628>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22628>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22628>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22628>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
22628>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Called by the cWebApp when a new request comes in to initialize the client web properties. 
22628>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Forwards the request to the client handler.
22628>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
22628>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Call_PreWebProps tWebCallContext ByRef cctx
22630>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoHandler
22630>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22630>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get phoServerHandler to hoHandler
22631>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send InitializeCall of hoHandler cctx.request.Header.aSyncProps cctx.request.Header.aAdvSyncP
22632>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22632>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get phoSessionHandler to hoHandler
22633>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send InitializeCall of hoHandler cctx.request.Header.aSyncProps cctx.request.Header.aAdvSyncP
22634>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22634>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get phoClientHandler to hoHandler
22635>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send InitializeCall of hoHandler cctx.request.Header.aSyncProps cctx.request.Header.aAdvSyncP
22636>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
22637>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22637>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22637>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
22637>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Special feature of client web properties that during a LoadView some properties already on 
22637>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // the client are sent and are marked as synchronized. Forwards this request to the client
22637>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // handler.
22637>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
22637>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ProcessLoadViewClientSyncProps Handle hoView
22639>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoHandler
22639>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22639>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get phoClientHandler to hoHandler
22640>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22640>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ProcessLoadViewClientSyncProps of hoHandler hoView
22641>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
22642>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22642>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22642>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
22642>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Called by the cWebApp class when the processing of a request is finished. All handlers are
22642>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // triggered to store their properties and the client ahndler puts the in the passed arrays so 
22642>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // they are sent back to the client.
22642>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
22642>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Call_PostWebProps tWebCallContext ByRef cctx
22644>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoHandler
22644>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22644>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Handle server properties (note that this might change client properties like psSPKey of ghoWebApp
22644>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get phoServerHandler to hoHandler
22645>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send FinishedCall of hoHandler (&cctx.response.Header.aSyncProps) (&cctx.response.Header.aAdvSyncP)
22646>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22646>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get phoSessionHandler to hoHandler
22647>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send FinishedCall of hoHandler (&cctx.response.Header.aSyncProps) (&cctx.response.Header.aAdvSyncP)
22648>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22648>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Load client web properties
22648>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get phoClientHandler to hoHandler
22649>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send FinishedCall of hoHandler (&cctx.response.Header.aSyncProps) (&cctx.response.Header.aAdvSyncP)
22650>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
22651>>>>>>>>>>>>>End_Class
22652>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22652>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Returns the value of the named Web Property belonging to the named object.
22652>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Displays an appropriate message if the property cannot be reached.
22652>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
22652>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Only use this function in the Debugger Watches window to watch Web 
22652>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Property values. Should never be used to get a Web Property value in 
22652>>>>>>>>>>>>>// your application. Use WebGet instead.
22652>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22652>>>>>>>>>>>>>Function _wp Global Handle hoObject String sPropName Returns Variant
22654>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Boolean bIsAjaxWebObject bInScope
22654>>>>>>>>>>>>>    String sObject
22654>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Handle hoHandler hoOwner
22654>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Variant vReturn
22654>>>>>>>>>>>>>    tWebPropMetaData pubProp
22654>>>>>>>>>>>>>    tWebPropMetaData pubProp
22654>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22654>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Test ig target object is WO
22654>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Get IsAjaxWebObject of hoObject to bIsAjaxWebObject
22655>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Get Object_Label of hoObject to sObject
22656>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22656>>>>>>>>>>>>>    If (not(bIsAjaxWebObject)) Begin
22658>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return ("Object " + sObject + " does not support web properties")
22659>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End
22659>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22659>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22659>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Find property index
22659>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Get FindWebPropertyMetaByName of hoObject sPropName to pubProp
22660>>>>>>>>>>>>>    If (pubProp.hmGetter = 0) Begin
22662>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (sPropName + " is not a web property of " + sObject) 
22663>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End
22663>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22663>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22663>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Get handler
22663>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Get Owner of hoObject to hoOwner
22664>>>>>>>>>>>>>    If (hoOwner = -1) Begin
22666>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (SFormat("Object '%1' is not a valid web web object for %2.", sObject, "WebGet"))        
22667>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End
22667>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22667>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22667>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Get PropertyHandler of hoOwner hoObject pubProp.eMode to hoHandler
22668>>>>>>>>>>>>>    If (hoHandler = -1) Begin
22670>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (SFormat("Property '%2' of object '%1' is not a valid web property for %3, check the web property meta value.", sPropName, sObject, "WebGet"))        
22671>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End
22671>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22671>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22671>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Test if handler is active....
22671>>>>>>>>>>>>>    If (not(pbActive(hoHandler))) Begin
22673>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return "Web property handler is inactive"
22674>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End
22674>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22674>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22674>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Test if in scope
22674>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Get IsObjectInCallActionScope of hoHandler hoObject to bInScope
22675>>>>>>>>>>>>>    If (not(bInScope)) Begin
22677>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return ("Object " + sObject + " is out of scope. Web property " + sPropName + " not available")
22678>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End
22678>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22678>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22678>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Now call the actual handler (now if something goes wrong it is a proper error)
22678>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Get GetScalarSyncProp of hoHandler hoObject (&pubProp) to vReturn
22679>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22679>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function_Return vReturn
22680>>>>>>>>>>>>>End_Function
22681>>>>>>>>>>>Use tWebControlMapItem.pkg
22681>>>>>>>>>>>
22681>>>>>>>>>>>Register_Function IsDialog Returns Boolean
22681>>>>>>>>>>>
22681>>>>>>>>>>>Class cWebViewHost_mixin is a Mixin
22682>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Define_cWebViewHost_mixin
22684>>>>>>>>>>>        
22684>>>>>>>>>>>        Property tWebControlMapItem[] paViews          // Collection of all views available within this host
22685>>>>>>>>>>>        
22685>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Handle[] paDDOViews                   // Collection of view object handles referenced in each member of the RequestHeader.aDDOs
22686>>>>>>>>>>>        
22686>>>>>>>>>>>        
22686>>>>>>>>>>>        
22686>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Handle phoLoadView C_WebUnresolvedObject       // handle to view to load during a CallAction to LoadView
22687>>>>>>>>>>>        
22687>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Handle phoLoginView C_WebUnresolvedObject      // handle of login view to load when application is loaded.
22688>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Handle phoDefaultView C_WebUnresolvedObject    // handle of the default view to load when web application is loaded (unless there is a login screen to be shown - see phoLoginView)
22689>>>>>>>>>>>        
22689>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Handle phoCommandBar C_WebUnresolvedObject     // handle to child cWebCommandbar object
22690>>>>>>>>>>>        
22690>>>>>>>>>>>        
22690>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer peApplicationStyle wvsDesktop 
22691>>>>>>>>>>>        
22691>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbTestSyncDDO False // for testing only (s/b False on release)
22692>>>>>>>>>>>        
22692>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String[] paLoadedViews     // List of all views loaded to the client (used by ShowView to determine if it should go back to the client)
22695>>>>>>>>>>>        
22695>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psCurrentView ""    // Name of the currently active view
22698>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Handle phoCurrentShowView  C_WebUnresolvedObject // Handle to the view currently being shown (used to check if OnNavigateForward calls another view during show
22699>>>>>>>>>>>        
22699>>>>>>>>>>>        
22699>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psApplicationTitle "DataFlex WebApp"        // The title shown in the browser title bar
22702>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbUpdateApplicationTitle True              // If true the title in the title bar is automatically updated
22705>>>>>>>>>>>        
22705>>>>>>>>>>>        // When set to True all views will show an unhandled error when a refind record
22705>>>>>>>>>>>        // fails (usually some kind of FindByRowIdEx call). Normally this is False because
22705>>>>>>>>>>>        // refinds can fail in a multi-user environment and the framework will handle this
22705>>>>>>>>>>>        // as best it can. However, refind errors can also be caused by a programming error.
22705>>>>>>>>>>>        // If you set this true during debugging you will be notified of refind errors that
22705>>>>>>>>>>>        // may be a programming bug. This can work well because the multi-user can't refind
22705>>>>>>>>>>>        // error usually does not occur while debugging. If you set this True while testing,
22705>>>>>>>>>>>        // remember to set it back to False when deploying.  
22705>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbShowAllRefindErrors False
22706>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
22707>>>>>>>>>>>    
22707>>>>>>>>>>>    // An object is only in-scope during a WebApp CallAction in the following cases:
22707>>>>>>>>>>>    // - It is a Global Object: cWebApp or its child objects (but not a cWebWindow child).
22707>>>>>>>>>>>    // - It is part of the stack of views\dialog in the cWebApp's paDDOViews property.
22707>>>>>>>>>>>    // - During a call to LoadView, it is part of the view being loaded.
22707>>>>>>>>>>>    Function OwnerIsInCallActionScope Handle hoWO Returns Boolean
22709>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iViewIndex
22709>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoWebNeighborhood hoLoadView
22709>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle[] aDDOViews
22710>>>>>>>>>>>        
22710>>>>>>>>>>>        Get phoWebNeighborhood of hoWO to hoWebNeighborhood    // This property is set during object creation
22711>>>>>>>>>>>        
22711>>>>>>>>>>>        // Test if the neighborhood property is actually correctly set.
22711>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoWebNeighborhood = C_WebUnresolvedObject) Begin
22713>>>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return False
22714>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22714>>>>>>>>>>>>
22714>>>>>>>>>>>        
22714>>>>>>>>>>>        // is this in the cWebApp Neighborhood?
22714>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoWebNeighborhood = Self) Begin
22716>>>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return True
22717>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22717>>>>>>>>>>>>
22717>>>>>>>>>>>        
22717>>>>>>>>>>>        // is this a View that is being loaded?
22717>>>>>>>>>>>        Get phoLoadView to hoLoadView
22718>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoWebNeighborhood = hoLoadView) Begin
22720>>>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return True
22721>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22721>>>>>>>>>>>>
22721>>>>>>>>>>>        
22721>>>>>>>>>>>        // is this in the neighborhood of one of the focus windows?
22721>>>>>>>>>>>        Get paDDOViews to aDDOViews     // This property is set during CallAction
22722>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (SearchArray(hoWebNeighborhood, aDDOViews)) to iViewIndex
22723>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (iViewIndex <> -1)
22724>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
22725>>>>>>>>>>>    
22725>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OwnerRegisterView Handle hoView
22727>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebControlMapItem new
22727>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebControlMapItem new
22727>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebControlMapItem[] aViews
22727>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebControlMapItem[] aViews
22728>>>>>>>>>>>        
22728>>>>>>>>>>>        Get paViews to aViews
22729>>>>>>>>>>>        
22729>>>>>>>>>>>        Move hoView to new.hoObj
22730>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (Uppercase(Name(hoView))) to new.sName
22731>>>>>>>>>>>        
22731>>>>>>>>>>>        If (BinarySearchArray(new, aViews, False) = -1) Begin
22733>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (InsertInArray(aViews, BinarySearchInsertPos(), new)) to aViews
22734>>>>>>>>>>>            Set paViews to aViews
22735>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22735>>>>>>>>>>>>
22735>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
22736>>>>>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_PROGRAM (SFormat("View with name '%1' already registered.", new.sName))
22737>>>>>>>>>>>>
22737>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22737>>>>>>>>>>>>
22737>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
22738>>>>>>>>>>>    
22738>>>>>>>>>>>    Function FindView String sViewName Boolean bSilent Returns Handle
22740>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebControlMapItem[] aViews
22740>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebControlMapItem[] aViews
22741>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebControlMapItem search
22741>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebControlMapItem search
22741>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iPos
22741>>>>>>>>>>>        
22741>>>>>>>>>>>        Get paViews to aViews
22742>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (Uppercase(Trim(sViewName))) to search.sName
22743>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (BinarySearchArray(search, aViews, False)) to iPos
22744>>>>>>>>>>>        
22744>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iPos <> -1) Begin
22746>>>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return aViews[iPos].hoObj
22747>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22747>>>>>>>>>>>>
22747>>>>>>>>>>>        
22747>>>>>>>>>>>        If (not(bSilent)) Begin
22749>>>>>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_PROGRAM (SFormat(C_$WebAppTargetObjectNotFound, sViewName))
22750>>>>>>>>>>>>
22750>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22750>>>>>>>>>>>>
22750>>>>>>>>>>>        
22750>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return C_WebUnresolvedObject
22751>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
22752>>>>>>>>>>>    
22752>>>>>>>>>>>    Function OwnerActionState Handle hoWO Returns Integer
22754>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoLoadView hoNeigborhood
22754>>>>>>>>>>>        
22754>>>>>>>>>>>        Get phoLoadView to hoLoadView
22755>>>>>>>>>>>        Get phoWebNeighborhood to hoNeigborhood
22756>>>>>>>>>>>        
22756>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoLoadView <> C_WebUnresolvedObject and hoLoadView = hoNeigborhood) Begin
22758>>>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return ctExecViewLoad
22759>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22759>>>>>>>>>>>>
22759>>>>>>>>>>>        
22759>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return ctExecDefault    //  Execute as a default client action (after synchronization of web properties)
22760>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
22761>>>>>>>>>>>    
22761>>>>>>>>>>>    // Called by LoadWebApp to load the initial view
22761>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Load_InitialView
22763>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoView
22763>>>>>>>>>>>        String sStateHash
22763>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer eAppStyle
22763>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aLoadedViews
22764>>>>>>>>>>>        
22764>>>>>>>>>>>        WebGet paLoadedViews to aLoadedViews
22765>>>>>>>>>>>        If (SizeOfArray(aLoadedViews) > 0) ;            Procedure_Return
22768>>>>>>>>>>>        
22768>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Get forced initial view (login dialog or so)
22768>>>>>>>>>>>        Get ForcedInitialView to hoView
22769>>>>>>>>>>>        
22769>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Set initial page title (a login dialog might not set one)
22769>>>>>>>>>>>        Send UpdatePageTitle C_WebUnresolvedObject ""
22770>>>>>>>>>>>        
22770>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Send back default view unless a login dialog needs to be sent
22770>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoView = C_WebUnresolvedObject) Begin
22772>>>>>>>>>>>            //  Restore application state
22772>>>>>>>>>>>            If (peApplicationStateMode(Self) <> asmOff) Begin
22774>>>>>>>>>>>                Get StateHash to sStateHash 
22775>>>>>>>>>>>                Send RestoreState sStateHash True
22776>>>>>>>>>>>            End
22776>>>>>>>>>>>>
22776>>>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin //  Or return default view
22777>>>>>>>>>>>                Get GetDefaultView to hoView
22778>>>>>>>>>>>                If (hoView > 0) Begin
22780>>>>>>>>>>>                    Send Show of hoView
22781>>>>>>>>>>>                End
22781>>>>>>>>>>>>
22781>>>>>>>>>>>            End
22781>>>>>>>>>>>>
22781>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22781>>>>>>>>>>>>
22781>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
22782>>>>>>>>>>>            Get peApplicationStyle to eAppStyle
22783>>>>>>>>>>>            If (eAppStyle = wvsDrillDown) Begin
22785>>>>>>>>>>>               Send NavigateBegin of hoView Self True 
22786>>>>>>>>>>>            End
22786>>>>>>>>>>>>
22786>>>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
22787>>>>>>>>>>>                Send Show of hoView    
22788>>>>>>>>>>>            End
22788>>>>>>>>>>>>
22788>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22788>>>>>>>>>>>>
22788>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
22789>>>>>>>>>>>    
22789>>>>>>>>>>>    Function ViewAccessDenied Handle hoView Boolean bRestoreState Returns Boolean
22791>>>>>>>>>>>        tOnViewAccessDenied deniedDetails
22791>>>>>>>>>>>        tOnViewAccessDenied deniedDetails
22791>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer eAppStyle
22791>>>>>>>>>>>        
22791>>>>>>>>>>>        Move hoView to deniedDetails.hoView
22792>>>>>>>>>>>        Move bRestoreState to deniedDetails.bRestoreState
22793>>>>>>>>>>>        Move False to deniedDetails.bHandled
22794>>>>>>>>>>>        Move C_WebUnresolvedObject to deniedDetails.hoNavigateToView
22795>>>>>>>>>>>        
22795>>>>>>>>>>>        Send OnViewAccessDenied (&deniedDetails)
22796>>>>>>>>>>>        If (deniedDetails.bHandled) ;            Function_Return True
22799>>>>>>>>>>>        
22799>>>>>>>>>>>        If (deniedDetails.hoNavigateToView <> C_WebUnresolvedObject) Begin
22801>>>>>>>>>>>            Get peApplicationStyle to eAppStyle
22802>>>>>>>>>>>            If (eAppStyle = wvsDrillDown) Begin
22804>>>>>>>>>>>                Send NavigatePathBegin deniedDetails.hoNavigateToView True
22805>>>>>>>>>>>            End
22805>>>>>>>>>>>>
22805>>>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
22806>>>>>>>>>>>                Send Show of deniedDetails.hoNavigateToView    
22807>>>>>>>>>>>            End 
22807>>>>>>>>>>>>
22807>>>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return True
22808>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22808>>>>>>>>>>>>
22808>>>>>>>>>>>        
22808>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return False
22809>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
22810>>>>>>>>>>>    
22810>>>>>>>>>>>    // Event that is fired when the user tries to navigate into a view or dialog and access is denied. Implement this 
22810>>>>>>>>>>>    // procedure to customize behavior (for example show a login view). By default triggers the Access Denied error.
22810>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnViewAccessDenied tOnViewAccessDenied ByRef details
22812>>>>>>>>>>>        Error DFERR_WEBAPP_ACCESS_DENIED
22813>>>>>>>>>>>>
22813>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
22814>>>>>>>>>>>
22814>>>>>>>>>>>
22814>>>>>>>>>>>    // Client Action: Sends hideView to the client to hide the passed view. A hidden view can be re-shown without making
22814>>>>>>>>>>>    // a server call (see ShowView). Note, a hidden view and it's data is still present on the client. 
22814>>>>>>>>>>>    // If access to a view is to be securely restricted Use CloseView instead.
22814>>>>>>>>>>>    // See also "Hide" method of cWebView.
22814>>>>>>>>>>>    // See also "ShowView" 
22814>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure HideView Handle hoView
22816>>>>>>>>>>>        String sView sCurrent sInvoking
22816>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
22817>>>>>>>>>>>
22817>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Object_Label of hoView to sView
22818>>>>>>>>>>>        
22818>>>>>>>>>>>        WebGet psCurrentView to sCurrent
22819>>>>>>>>>>>        If (sView = sCurrent) Begin
22821>>>>>>>>>>>            WebGet psInvokingView of hoView to sInvoking
22822>>>>>>>>>>>            WebSet psCurrentView to sInvoking
22823>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22823>>>>>>>>>>>>
22823>>>>>>>>>>>        
22823>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sView to aParams[0]       // Pass the view name as the 1st parameter.
22824>>>>>>>>>>>        Move False to aParams[1]       // We do want to send OnHide if needed
22825>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "hideView" aParams 
22826>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
22827>>>>>>>>>>>    
22827>>>>>>>>>>>    
22827>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Determines if a view loaded on the client by looking at paLoadedViews.
22827>>>>>>>>>>>    //
22827>>>>>>>>>>>    //  hoView      - Handle to the view object.
22827>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Returns true if the view is available on the client.
22827>>>>>>>>>>>    Function IsViewLoaded Handle hoView Returns Boolean
22829>>>>>>>>>>>        String [] aLoadedViews
22830>>>>>>>>>>>        String sView
22830>>>>>>>>>>>        
22830>>>>>>>>>>>        Get WebObjectName of hoView to sView
22831>>>>>>>>>>>        WebGet paLoadedViews to aLoadedViews
22832>>>>>>>>>>>        
22832>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (SearchArray(UpperCase(sView), aLoadedViews) >= 0)
22833>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
22834>>>>>>>>>>>    
22834>>>>>>>>>>>    
22834>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Determines if a view is in sync using IsInCallActionScope.
22834>>>>>>>>>>>    //
22834>>>>>>>>>>>    //  hoView      - Handle to the view object.
22834>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Returns true if the view is currently in sync.
22834>>>>>>>>>>>    Function IsViewInSync Handle hoView Returns Boolean
22836>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bResult
22836>>>>>>>>>>>        
22836>>>>>>>>>>>        Get IsInCallActionScope of hoView to bResult
22837>>>>>>>>>>>        
22837>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bResult
22838>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
22839>>>>>>>>>>>    
22839>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Determines the currently shown view.
22839>>>>>>>>>>>    //
22839>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Returns a handle to the currently shown view.
22839>>>>>>>>>>>    Function CurrentView Returns Handle
22841>>>>>>>>>>>        String sView
22841>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoView
22841>>>>>>>>>>>        
22841>>>>>>>>>>>        Move C_WebUnresolvedObject to hoView
22842>>>>>>>>>>>        
22842>>>>>>>>>>>        WebGet psCurrentView to sView
22843>>>>>>>>>>>        If (sView <> "") Begin
22845>>>>>>>>>>>            Get WebObjectByName sView to hoView
22846>>>>>>>>>>>        End
22846>>>>>>>>>>>>
22846>>>>>>>>>>>        
22846>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return hoView
22847>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
