23752>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23752>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23752>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Attach_Deo_To_Server
23754>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoPrompt
23754>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iValue
23754>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23754>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Attach_Deo_To_Server
23756>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23756>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // after DEO is attached, set the prompt button automatically (if needed)
23756>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get pbPromptButton to iValue
23757>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23757>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iValue = C_WebDefault) Begin
23759>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get PromptObject to hoPrompt
23760>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (hoPrompt <> 0) Begin
23762>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Set pbPromptButton to True
23763>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
23763>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23763>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
23763>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23763>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
23764>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23764>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23764>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure AfterAttachDDO
23766>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Sent after each DEO Object has been attached to its DDO server and had all the DDO field settings
23766>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // applied to its published properties. We will set default values to any cWebControl properties that
23766>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // are still unassigned...
23766>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iValue eDataType iPrecision
23766>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sInputMode
23766>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23766>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send AfterAttachDDO
23768>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23768>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Determine sInputMode
23768>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get peDataType to eDataType
23769>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get psInputMode to sInputMode
23770>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (eDataType = typeNumber and sInputMode = "") Begin
23772>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get piPrecision to iPrecision
23773>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (iPrecision > 0) Begin
23775>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Set psInputMode to "decimal"
23776>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
23776>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23776>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
23777>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Set psInputMode to "numeric"
23778>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
23778>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23778>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
23778>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23778>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23778>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Correct pbPromptButton
23778>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get pbPromptButton to iValue
23779>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23779>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iValue = C_WebDefault) Begin
23781>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set pbPromptButton to False
23782>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
23782>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23782>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
23783>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23783>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23783>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // On prompt button click event stub.
23783>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnPrompt
23785>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Prompt
23786>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
23787>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23787>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // returns PromptObject. If phoPrompt is set, it returns this, else checks with DD for web prompt object
23787>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function PromptObject Returns Handle
23789>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoPrompt hoDD
23789>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField
23789>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer eStyle
23789>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get WebViewStyle to eStyle
23790>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (eStyle = wvsDesktop or eStyle=wvsDialog) Begin
23792>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get phoPrompt to hoPrompt
23793>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (hoPrompt=0) Begin
23795>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get Data_File to iFile
23796>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get Data_Field to iField
23797>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get Server to hoDD
23798>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (iFile and hoDD) Begin
23800>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Get File_Field_WebPrompt_Object of hoDD iFile iField to hoPrompt
23801>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
23801>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23801>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
23801>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23801>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
23801>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23801>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return hoPrompt
23802>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
23803>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23803>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Returns true if control supports prompt buttons and the prompt button
23803>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // default property value (not webproperty) is enabled. In general when the
23803>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // default value is false, the developer has disabled this and does not
23803>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // want the dynamic enabling/disabling logic to be messing with it.
23803>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function HasPromptButton Returns Boolean
23805>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bPromptButton
23805>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // this is purposefully Get and not WebGet
23805>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get pbPromptButton to bPromptButton
23806>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bPromptButton
23807>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
23808>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23808>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // augmented to also remove the prompt button from
23808>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // dynamically disabled forms
23808>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure SetDynamicEnabled
23810>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
