24119>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This adds every parent DDO for the passed DDO to the DEO's list of DDOs to watch.
24119>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // It adds the parents and then does this recursively up the DDO tree.
24119>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This means that this DEO will respond to any DD change for any server. This does not
24119>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure WatchAllParentServers Handle hoDDO
24121>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoSrvr
24121>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iServer iServers
24121>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Set_Server_Count of hoDDO to iServers
24122>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        For iServer from 0 to (iServers-1)
24128>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24128>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Server of hoDDO iServer to hoSrvr
24129>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Add_Watched_Server hoSrvr
24130>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send WatchAllParentServers hoSrvr
24131>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Loop
24132>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24132>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
