24207>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // helper function returns true if any child DDO relates to this
24207>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function IsConstrainingParent Handle hoDDO Returns Boolean
24209>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iClients i iFile
24209>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoClient
24209>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bRelates
24209>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Main_File of hoDDO to iFile
24210>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Set_Client_Count of hoDDO to iClients
24211>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to (iClients-1)
24217>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24217>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Client of hoDDO i to hoClient
24218>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get IsRelatesToConstrained of hoClient iFile to bRelates
24219>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If bRelates Begin
24221>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Function_Return True
24222>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
24222>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24222>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Loop
24223>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24223>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return False
24224>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
