24225>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Request_Find Integer eFindMode
24227>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Generic request find method for handling Request_Find
24227>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // eFindMode - Can be one of... lt, le, eq, ge, gt, or it may be either Next_Record, First_Record, or Last_Record
24227>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iField iFile iMainIndex
24227>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
24227>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24227>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
24228>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
24228>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoServer <> 0) Begin
24230>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_File to iFile
24231>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Field to iField
24232>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
24232>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (iFile > 0) Begin
24234>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Send Item_Find to hoServer eFindMode iFile iField True False False   // Entry Update = True, Show find error = True, Deferred State = False
24235>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
24235>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24235>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
24235>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24235>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
