24336>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (sSearchFilter = "") Begin
24338>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return sOrigFilter
24339>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
24339>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24339>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24339>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sSearchFilter to sFilter
24340>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (sOrigFilter <> "") Begin
24342>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get SQLStrAppend of hoDD sOrigFilter sSearchFilter to sFilter
24343>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
24343>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24343>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24343>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return sFilter
24344>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
24345>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24345>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ApplyFilterExpression Handle hoDD Integer[] iaFiles Integer[] iaFields String sSearchValue String ByRef sOrigFilter Boolean ByRef bOrigActive Boolean ByRef bApplied
24347>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sFilter
24347>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24347>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move False to bApplied
24348>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move "" to sOrigFilter
24349>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move False to bOrigActive
