24479>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnLoadItems tSelectionItem[] ByRef aItems Boolean ByRef bLast String sFilter tSelectionItem prevItem Integer iPageSize Integer iPage
24481>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Stub
