25345>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure RemoveTag String sTag
25347>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aTags
25348>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bCaseSensitive
25348>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer i
25348>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25348>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get GetTags to aTags
25349>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get pbCaseSensitive to bCaseSensitive
25350>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25350>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (not(bCaseSensitive)) ;            Move (Uppercase(sTag)) to sTag
25353>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
25353>>>>>>>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to (SizeOfArray(aTags) - 1)
25359>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25359>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If ((bCaseSensitive and aTags[i]= sTag) or (not(bCaseSensitive) and Uppercase(aTags[i]) = sTag)) Begin
25361>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move (RemoveFromArray(aTags, i)) to aTags
25362>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Decrement i
25363>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
25363>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25363>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Loop
25364>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25364>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25364>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send UpdateTags aTags
25365>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
