25985>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
25986>>>>>>>>>>>    
25986>>>>>>>>>>>    
25986>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Called by the list / grid to determine the field value details based on the current 
25986>>>>>>>>>>>    //  environment values (global buffer or properties). It fills the tWebCell struct that is 
25986>>>>>>>>>>>    //  passed by reference with details needed by the JavaScript Engine to render the cell.
25986>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure LoadGridCell tWebCell ByRef tCell
25988>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField
25988>>>>>>>>>>>        String sValue
25988>>>>>>>>>>>        
25988>>>>>>>>>>>
25988>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File  to iFile
25989>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField
25990>>>>>>>>>>>        
25990>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iFile <> 0) Begin
25992>>>>>>>>>>>            //  Security check
25992>>>>>>>>>>>            If (FillDEOAllowed(Self)) Begin            
25994>>>>>>>>>>>                // If there is a data binding then get the file.field value....
25994>>>>>>>>>>>                Get_Field_Value iFile iField to sValue
25997>>>>>>>>>>>            End
25997>>>>>>>>>>>>
25997>>>>>>>>>>>        End
25997>>>>>>>>>>>>
25997>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
25998>>>>>>>>>>>            // if there is no data binding then fire the calculated field event....
25998>>>>>>>>>>>            WebGet psValue to sValue
25999>>>>>>>>>>>            Send OnSetCalculatedValue (&sValue)         // calculated value
26000>>>>>>>>>>>        End
26000>>>>>>>>>>>>
26000>>>>>>>>>>>
26000>>>>>>>>>>>        // Convert the value into the correct format for transport....                    
26000>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (Trim(sValue)) to sValue                                            // make sure the value is trimmed
26001>>>>>>>>>>>        Get ConvertToTransport (RefFunc(psValue)) sValue cArgStr  to sValue
26002>>>>>>>>>>>        
26002>>>>>>>>>>>        // Give a chance to add custom tooltips & CSS Classnames
26002>>>>>>>>>>>        Send OnDefineTooltip (&tCell.sTooltip)
26003>>>>>>>>>>>        Send OnDefineCssClass (&tCell.sCssClassName)
26004>>>>>>>>>>>        
26004>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sValue to tCell.sValue
26005>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
