26854>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Request_Clear
26856>>>>>>>>>        // Request clear message for clear/clear all.
26856>>>>>>>>>        Integer eSelectedRowOperation
26856>>>>>>>>>        Get ClearSelectedRow to eSelectedRowOperation
