26858>>>>>>>>>    
26858>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Request_Delete
26860>>>>>>>>>        // Request delete message for DDO delete.
26860>>>>>>>>>        Integer eSelectedRowOperation
26860>>>>>>>>>        Get DeleteSelectedRow to eSelectedRowOperation
