26862>>>>>>>>>    
26862>>>>>>>>>    
26862>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Request_Save
26864>>>>>>>>>        // Request save message for DDO save.
26864>>>>>>>>>        Integer eSelectedRowOperation
26864>>>>>>>>>        Get SaveSelectedRow to eSelectedRowOperation
