27205>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
27206>>>>>>>>>        tWebRow[] aRows
27206>>>>>>>>>        tWebRow[] aRows
27207>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoJson
27207>>>>>>>>>        
27207>>>>>>>>>        Move tRow to aRows[0]
27208>>>>>>>>>        
27208>>>>>>>>>        //  Convert data to JSON
27208>>>>>>>>>        Get Create (RefClass(cJsonObject)) to hoJson
27209>>>>>>>>>        Send DataTypeToJson of hoJson aRows
27210>>>>>>>>>
27210>>>>>>>>>        Move sRowIdBefore to aParams[0]
27211>>>>>>>>>        
27211>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientActionEx "dataSetInsertRowBefore" aParams hoJson
27212>>>>>>>>>        Send Destroy of hoJson
27213>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
