27299>>>>>>>>>    
27299>>>>>>>>>    // Client action that triggers the grid to send the entire set of data in a separate request. 
27299>>>>>>>>>    // This request is handled by HandleProcessDataSet and triggers the OnProcessDataSet event that 
27299>>>>>>>>>    // should be implemented to save / process the data of the grid.
27299>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ProcessDataSet Integer eOperation
27301>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
27302>>>>>>>>>        
27302>>>>>>>>>        Move eOperation to aParams[0]
27303>>>>>>>>>        
27303>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "processDataSet" aParams
27304>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
27305>>>>>>>>>    
27305>>>>>>>>>    // Published method that is called by the client to save the entire set of data. It gets the 
27305>>>>>>>>>    // action data and triggers the OnProcessDataSet event.
27305>>>>>>>>>    Procedure HandleProcessDataSet Integer eOperation Integer iSelectedRowIndex
27307>>>>>>>>>        tWebRow[] aData
27307>>>>>>>>>        tWebRow[] aData
27308>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoJson
27308>>>>>>>>>        
27308>>>>>>>>>        Get phoActionJsonData to hoJson
27309>>>>>>>>>        Get JsonToDataType of hoJson to aData
27310>>>>>>>>>        
27310>>>>>>>>>        Send OnProcessDataSet aData eOperation iSelectedRowIndex
27311>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
27312>>>>>>>>>    
27312>>>>>>>>>    // Event that is called by the client grid class to pass the entire set of data that the grid 
27312>>>>>>>>>    // was working on. Implement this event to store all the grid data at once. Use the ProcessDataSet
27312>>>>>>>>>    // method to trigger this event.
27312>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnProcessDataSet tWebRow[] aData Integer eOperation Integer iSelectedRowIndex
27314>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
27315>>>>>>>>>    
27315>>>>>>>>>    //  Called when a row is loaded to define the CSS class for that row. The global buffers will
27315>>>>>>>>>    //  have the proper record loaded for a data aware grid.
27315>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnDefineRowCssClass String ByRef sCSSClass
27317>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
27318>>>>>>>>>    
27318>>>>>>>>>    // Shows the search dialog.
27318>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Search
27320>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "showSearch"
27321>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
27322>>>>>>>>>    
27322>>>>>>>>>    
27322>>>>>>>>>    // Called by the JavaScript engine to perform a search on an automatic data aware list
27322>>>>>>>>>    // (peDbGridType = gtAutomatic and pbDataAware = true). It can just perform the find on the DD
27322>>>>>>>>>    // and the list will refresh itself and select the right record.
27322>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnSearch String sSearchText
27324>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCol
27324>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoCol
27324>>>>>>>>>        WebGet piSortColumn to iCol
27325>>>>>>>>>
27325>>>>>>>>>        If (iCol>=0) Begin
27327>>>>>>>>>            Get GetColumnObject iCol to hoCol
27328>>>>>>>>>            
27328>>>>>>>>>            // Perform the lookup
27328>>>>>>>>>            Send RequestColumnLookup of hoCol sSearchText
27329>>>>>>>>>        End
27329>>>>>>>>>>
27329>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
27330>>>>>>>>>
27330>>>>>>>>>    // Attempt to find the field from the server's MainFile that relates to iRelatedFile
27330>>>>>>>>>    Function RelatingField Integer iRelatedFile Returns Integer
27332>>>>>>>>>        Integer iField iRelFile iNumFields iIndex iMainfile
27332>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
27332>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bDDRelates
27332>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
27333>>>>>>>>>        Get Main_File of hoServer to iMainfile
27334>>>>>>>>>        Get pbUseDDRelates of hoServer to bDDRelates
27335>>>>>>>>>        Get_Attribute DF_FILE_NUMBER_FIELDS of iMainFile to iNumFields
27338>>>>>>>>>        For iField from 1 to iNumFields
27344>>>>>>>>>>
27344>>>>>>>>>            
27344>>>>>>>>>            // find first field that relates to the related file and has an index.
27344>>>>>>>>>            If (bDDRelates) Begin
27346>>>>>>>>>                Get Field_Related_File of hoServer iField to iRelFile
27347>>>>>>>>>            End
27347>>>>>>>>>>
27347>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
27348>>>>>>>>>                Get_Attribute DF_FIELD_RELATED_FILE of iMainFile  iField to iRelFile
27351>>>>>>>>>            End
27351>>>>>>>>>>
27351>>>>>>>>>            
27351>>>>>>>>>            If (iRelFile=iRelatedFile) Begin
27353>>>>>>>>>                
27353>>>>>>>>>                If (bDDRelates) Begin
27355>>>>>>>>>                    Get Field_Related_Field of hoServer iField to iIndex
27356>>>>>>>>>                End
27356>>>>>>>>>>
27356>>>>>>>>>                Else Begin
27357>>>>>>>>>                    Get_Attribute DF_FIELD_INDEX of iMainFile iField to iIndex
27360>>>>>>>>>                End
27360>>>>>>>>>>
27360>>>>>>>>>                
27360>>>>>>>>>                If (iIndex>0) Begin
27362>>>>>>>>>                    Function_Return iField
27363>>>>>>>>>                End
27363>>>>>>>>>>
27363>>>>>>>>>            End
27363>>>>>>>>>>
27363>>>>>>>>>        Loop
27364>>>>>>>>>>
27364>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return -1
27365>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
27366>>>>>>>>>
27366>>>>>>>>>    // refresh DD aware Grid from the Top
27366>>>>>>>>>    Procedure FindFromTop
27368>>>>>>>>>       Send FindFromTB True
27369>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
27370>>>>>>>>>
27370>>>>>>>>>    // refresh DD aware Grid from the Bottom
27370>>>>>>>>>    Procedure FindFromBottom
27372>>>>>>>>>       Send FindFromTB False
27373>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
27374>>>>>>>>>    
27374>>>>>>>>>    // called for Select views to refresh the select list during back navigation.
27374>>>>>>>>>    // If a cancel, there is no target DD and no rowId. Just refresh around what's in the DDO
27374>>>>>>>>>    // If a close, we have a RowId for a target DDO. If the DDO matches this list's DDO, refresh 
27374>>>>>>>>>    // around that. 
27374>>>>>>>>>    // For now this is private
27374>>>>>>>>>    Procedure RefreshListForBackNavigation Boolean bCancel Handle hoDDTarget RowID riTarget
27376>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bDataAware bSuccess
27376>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoDD
27376>>>>>>>>>        Integer iMain
27376>>>>>>>>>        RowID riId
27376>>>>>>>>>        
27376>>>>>>>>>        If (pbGhost(Self)) ;            Procedure_Return
27379>>>>>>>>>        
27379>>>>>>>>>        Get pbDataAware to bDataAware
27380>>>>>>>>>        // if non-data aware there is no list update
27380>>>>>>>>>        If bDataAware Begin
27382>>>>>>>>>            // if close & update, with a different rowid refind the rowid passed in. 
27382>>>>>>>>>            If not bCancel Begin
27384>>>>>>>>>                Get Server to hoDD
27385>>>>>>>>>                If (hoDD and hoDD=hoDDTarget) Begin // test to make sure this is an appropriate list to update
27387>>>>>>>>>                    Get Main_File of hoDD to iMain
27388>>>>>>>>>                    Get CurrentRowId of hoDD to riId
27389>>>>>>>>>                    If (not(IsNullRowID(riTarget)) and not(IsSameRowID(riId,riTarget))) Begin
27391>>>>>>>>>                        // this will cause the list to refresh itself
27391>>>>>>>>>                        Get FindByRowIdEx of hoDD iMain riTarget to bSuccess
27392>>>>>>>>>                        If not bSuccess Begin
27394>>>>>>>>>                            Send HandleCacheError
27395>>>>>>>>>                        End
27395>>>>>>>>>>
27395>>>>>>>>>                        Procedure_Return
27396>>>>>>>>>                    End
27396>>>>>>>>>>
27396>>>>>>>>>                End
27396>>>>>>>>>>
27396>>>>>>>>>            End
27396>>>>>>>>>>
27396>>>>>>>>>            // else, refresh with current information around existing DD
27396>>>>>>>>>            Send RefreshListFromDD
27397>>>>>>>>>        End
27397>>>>>>>>>>
27397>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
27398>>>>>>>>>
27398>>>>>>>>>    
27398>>>>>>>>>    
27398>>>>>>>>>    // Refresh a data-aware grid around the current record in the DD
27398>>>>>>>>>    // If that record is 0 or not found, which you really don't want to happen,
27398>>>>>>>>>    // just refresh from firsts record
27398>>>>>>>>>    Procedure RefreshListFromDD
27400>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoDD
27400>>>>>>>>>        RowID riId
27400>>>>>>>>>        Integer iMain
27400>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bDataAware bSuccess
27400>>>>>>>>>        Get pbDataAware to bDataAware
27401>>>>>>>>>        If bDataAware Begin
27403>>>>>>>>>
27403>>>>>>>>>            If (pbNotifyingExternalDD(Self)) Begin
27405>>>>>>>>>                Error DFERR_PROGRAM "Assert: RefreshListFromDD called with pbNotifyingExternalDD set"
27406>>>>>>>>>>
27406>>>>>>>>>            End
27406>>>>>>>>>>
27406>>>>>>>>>
27406>>>>>>>>>            Get Server to hoDD
27407>>>>>>>>>            Get Main_File of hoDD to iMain
27408>>>>>>>>>            Get CurrentRowId of hoDD to riId
27409>>>>>>>>>            Move False to bSuccess
27410>>>>>>>>>            
27410>>>>>>>>>            If (not(IsNullRowID(riId))) Begin
27412>>>>>>>>>                // test to see if the record still exists
27412>>>>>>>>>                Get FindByRowIdEx of hoDD iMain riId to bSuccess 
27413>>>>>>>>>            End
27413>>>>>>>>>>
27413>>>>>>>>>            
27413>>>>>>>>>            If (not(bSuccess)) Begin
27415>>>>>>>>>                // missing record, we don't know what to do.
27415>>>>>>>>>                // Just refresh the entire list
27415>>>>>>>>>                Get FindInDD hoDD FIRST_RECORD to bSuccess
27416>>>>>>>>>                If (not(bSuccess)) Begin
27418>>>>>>>>>                    Send ClearGrid
27419>>>>>>>>>                End
27419>>>>>>>>>>
27419>>>>>>>>>            End
27419>>>>>>>>>>
27419>>>>>>>>>        End
27419>>>>>>>>>>
27419>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
27420>>>>>>>>>    
27420>>>>>>>>>    
27420>>>>>>>>>    // This event procedure is called when a row is clicked within the list and pbServerOnRowClick 
27420>>>>>>>>>    // is true. It is called after the actual row change is performed which means that if the row 
27420>>>>>>>>>    // change succeeded the psCurrentRowId matches the clicked row id. In case of a cWebGrid row 
27420>>>>>>>>>    // changes can fail due to validation issues so in that case the clicked row can be different. 
27420>>>>>>>>>    // Note that if pbOfflineEditing is true the buffer will not contain the selected row.
27420>>>>>>>>>    //
27420>>>>>>>>>    // Params:
27420>>>>>>>>>    //  sRowID          The rowid of the clicked row.
27420>>>>>>>>>    //  iColumnIndex    The cWebColumn object index (excl. non-cWebColumn siblings).
27420>>>>>>>>>    //                  When pressing enter in a cWebList this will be -1.
27420>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnRowClick String sRowID Integer iColumnIndex
27422>>>>>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
27422>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
27423>>>>>>>>>
27423>>>>>>>>>    // Callback method sent to the callback control when a view receives NavigateForward.
27423>>>>>>>>>    // This should populate the tWebNavigateData in the default way according to the control's data bindings.
27423>>>>>>>>>    Procedure GetNavigateBackData Handle hoView tWebNavigateData ByRef NavigateData
27425>>>>>>>>>        Integer eGridType
27425>>>>>>>>>        String sId
27425>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer 
27425>>>>>>>>>        RowID ri
27425>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bOk bDataAware
27425>>>>>>>>>        
27425>>>>>>>>>        // Populate the Navigate Data struct with the best guess values from
27425>>>>>>>>>        // this control's server DDO
27425>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
27426>>>>>>>>>        If (hoServer) Begin
27428>>>>>>>>>            WebGet peDbGridType to eGridType
27429>>>>>>>>>            WebGet pbDataAware to bDataAware
27430>>>>>>>>>            If (bDataAware and  eGridType<>gtAutomatic) Begin
27432>>>>>>>>>                WebGet psCurrentRowId     to sId
27433>>>>>>>>>                Get FindByRowIdEx of hoServer (Main_File(hoServer)) (DeserializeRowID(sId)) to bOk
27434>>>>>>>>>            End
27434>>>>>>>>>>
27434>>>>>>>>>            
27434>>>>>>>>>            WebGet psCurrentRowId     to sId
27435>>>>>>>>>            Get CurrentRowId of hoServer to ri
27436>>>>>>>>>            If (not(IsSameRowID(ri,(DeserializeRowID(sId))))) Begin
27438>>>>>>>>>                Error DFERR_PROGRAM "Assert: Different ids in weblist"
27439>>>>>>>>>>
27439>>>>>>>>>            End
27439>>>>>>>>>>
27439>>>>>>>>>
27439>>>>>>>>>        End
27439>>>>>>>>>>
27439>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send GetNavigateBackData hoView (&NavigateData)
27441>>>>>>>>>        
27441>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
27442>>>>>>>>>    
27442>>>>>>>>>    
27442>>>>>>>>>    // Callback method sent to the callback control when a view receives NavigateForward.
27442>>>>>>>>>    // This should populate the tWebNavigateData in the default way according to the control's data bindings.
27442>>>>>>>>>    Procedure GetNavigateForwardData Handle hoView tWebNavigateData ByRef NavigateData
27444>>>>>>>>>        Integer eGridType
27444>>>>>>>>>        String sId
27444>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer 
27444>>>>>>>>>        RowID ri
27444>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bOk bOldGridAction bFromDynamic
27444>>>>>>>>>        
27444>>>>>>>>>        // Populate the Navigate Data struct with the best guess values from
27444>>>>>>>>>        // this control's server DDO
27444>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
27445>>>>>>>>>        // if not dataaware there will be no server!
27445>>>>>>>>>        If (hoServer) Begin
27447>>>>>>>>>            WebGet peDbGridType to eGridType
27448>>>>>>>>>            WebGet psCurrentRowId     to sId
27449>>>>>>>>>            // if not automatic, the server's row Id may not be current yet. 
27449>>>>>>>>>            If (eGridType<>gtAutomatic) Begin
27451>>>>>>>>>                Get pbNotifyingExternalDD to bOldGridAction
27452>>>>>>>>>                Set pbNotifyingExternalDD to True
27453>>>>>>>>>                Get FindByRowIdEx of hoServer (Main_File(hoServer)) (DeserializeRowID(sId)) to bOk
27454>>>>>>>>>                Set pbNotifyingExternalDD to bOldGridAction
27455>>>>>>>>>            End
27455>>>>>>>>>>
27455>>>>>>>>>            
27455>>>>>>>>>            // If the navigation is executed by a dynamic object, we don't care about this sanity check - especially durin initialization
27455>>>>>>>>>            Get IsDynamicObject to bFromDynamic
27456>>>>>>>>>            If (not(bFromDynamic) and not(pbGhost(Self))) Begin
27458>>>>>>>>>                // Assert that the Server's rowid matches the weblist's current row id
27458>>>>>>>>>                // if the DDO has no record, it is possible it could not refind what it
27458>>>>>>>>>                // needed and cleared it. We will not consider this an error, although it
27458>>>>>>>>>                // may display odd stuff (like a cleared parent).
27458>>>>>>>>>                Get CurrentRowId of hoServer to ri
27459>>>>>>>>>                If (not(IsNullRowID(ri)) and  not(IsSameRowID(ri,(DeserializeRowID(sId))))) Begin
27461>>>>>>>>>                    Error DFERR_PROGRAM "Assert: Different ids in weblist"
27462>>>>>>>>>>
27462>>>>>>>>>                End
27462>>>>>>>>>>
27462>>>>>>>>>            End
27462>>>>>>>>>>
27462>>>>>>>>>
27462>>>>>>>>>        End
27462>>>>>>>>>>
27462>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send GetNavigateForwardData hoView (&NavigateData)
27464>>>>>>>>>    
27464>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
27465>>>>>>>>>    
27465>>>>>>>>>    // Special augmentation for weblists. If this is not a dataaware grid, we want the server
27465>>>>>>>>>    // to be 0. We also want any child DEOs to have a 0 server, which they will
27465>>>>>>>>>    Function Server Returns Integer
27467>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bDataAware
27467>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
27467>>>>>>>>>        
27467>>>>>>>>>        // note we use the property and not the web-property. Even though this is a web-property
27467>>>>>>>>>        // it is not expected that this would ever be webset changed
27467>>>>>>>>>        Get pbDataAware to bDataAware
27468>>>>>>>>>        If (bDataAware) Begin
27470>>>>>>>>>            Forward Get Server to hoServer
27472>>>>>>>>>        End
27472>>>>>>>>>>
27472>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return hoServer
27473>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
27474>>>>>>>>>
27474>>>>>>>>>    // This message is broadcast to all controls in a list view when
27474>>>>>>>>>    // navigating to the view. It is intended to allow the controls to set the
27474>>>>>>>>>    // ordering of row data (e.g. piOrdering)
27474>>>>>>>>>    Procedure InitOrdering tWebNavigateData NavigateData Handle hoInvokingObject
27476>>>>>>>>>        Integer iMainTable iSortCol
27476>>>>>>>>>        Integer eDbGridType
27476>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer hoMainDD
27476>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bDataAware bReverseOrdering
27476>>>>>>>>>    
27476>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
27477>>>>>>>>>        Get Main_DD to hoMainDD
27478>>>>>>>>>        
27478>>>>>>>>>        // If no server or the server is not the view's main server, do nothing
27478>>>>>>>>>        If (hoServer=0 or hoServer<>hoMainDD) Begin
27480>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
27481>>>>>>>>>        End
27481>>>>>>>>>>
27481>>>>>>>>>        
27481>>>>>>>>>        Get pbDataAware to bDataAware
27482>>>>>>>>>        Get peDbGridType to eDbGridType
27483>>>>>>>>>        
27483>>>>>>>>>        // restore to design time values
27483>>>>>>>>>        Get pbReverseOrdering to bReverseOrdering
27484>>>>>>>>>        WebSet pbReverseOrdering to bReverseOrdering
27485>>>>>>>>>
27485>>>>>>>>>        Get piSortColumn to iSortCol
27486>>>>>>>>>        WebSet piSortColumn to iSortCol
27487>>>>>>>>>
27487>>>>>>>>>        // if data-aware and autoloading we assign an automatic sort column    
27487>>>>>>>>>        If (eDbGridType <> gtManual and bDataAware) Begin
27489>>>>>>>>>            If (NavigateData.eNavigateType <> nfFromParent) Begin
27491>>>>>>>>>                Get Main_File of hoServer to iMainTable
27492>>>>>>>>>                If (iMainTable = NavigateData.iTable and iMainTable <> 0) Begin
27494>>>>>>>>>                    Get SelectBestColumn NavigateData.iTable NavigateData.iColumn to iSortCol
27495>>>>>>>>>                    If (iSortCol>=0) Begin
27497>>>>>>>>>                        WebSet piSortColumn to iSortCol
27498>>>>>>>>>                    End
27498>>>>>>>>>>
27498>>>>>>>>>                End
27498>>>>>>>>>>
27498>>>>>>>>>            End
27498>>>>>>>>>>
27498>>>>>>>>>        End
27498>>>>>>>>>>
27498>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure 
27499>>>>>>>>>    
27499>>>>>>>>>    // This message is broadcast to a Select view when navigating to the view and there is no 
27499>>>>>>>>>    // record for the grid. It is intended to allow the list control to fill itself
27499>>>>>>>>>    // automatically when appropriate. It only does a fill if this is data aware grid,
27499>>>>>>>>>    // and the grid's server is the view's main DD. It simply loads from the "first" record 
27499>>>>>>>>>    Procedure InitGrid tWebNavigateData NavigateData Handle hoInvokingObject
27501>>>>>>>>>        Integer iIndex iMainTable
27501>>>>>>>>>        Integer eDbGridType
27501>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer hoMainDD
27501>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bSeeded bReverseOrdering bDataAware
27501>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bOldGridAction
27501>>>>>>>>>    
27501>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
27502>>>>>>>>>        Get Main_DD to hoMainDD
27503>>>>>>>>>        If (hoServer=0 or hoServer<>hoMainDD) Begin
27505>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
27506>>>>>>>>>        End
27506>>>>>>>>>>
27506>>>>>>>>>        
27506>>>>>>>>>        Get pbDataAware to bDataAware
27507>>>>>>>>>        Get peDbGridType to eDbGridType
27508>>>>>>>>>        
27508>>>>>>>>>        // if manually loaded or not data aware we will not do any init here. It can be done
27508>>>>>>>>>        // in OnNavigateForward
27508>>>>>>>>>        If (eDbGridType = gtManual or not(bDataAware)) Begin
27510>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
27511>>>>>>>>>        End
27511>>>>>>>>>>
27511>>>>>>>>>        
27511>>>>>>>>>        Get pbReverseOrdering to bReverseOrdering
27512>>>>>>>>>        Get Main_File of hoServer to iMainTable
27513>>>>>>>>>        Get IndexOrder to iIndex
27514>>>>>>>>>
27514>>>>>>>>>        // Init list at the "start"
27514>>>>>>>>>        If (bReverseOrdering) Begin
27516>>>>>>>>>            Send Find of hoServer LAST_RECORD iIndex
27517>>>>>>>>>        End
27517>>>>>>>>>>
27517>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
27518>>>>>>>>>            Send Find of hoServer FIRST_RECORD iIndex
27519>>>>>>>>>        End
27519>>>>>>>>>>
27519>>>>>>>>>
27519>>>>>>>>>        // If the seeding succeeded then ensure that all controls latch onto this
27519>>>>>>>>>        // otherwise just clear the DDOs
27519>>>>>>>>>        Get HasRecord of hoServer to bSeeded
27520>>>>>>>>>        
27520>>>>>>>>>        If bSeeded Begin
27522>>>>>>>>>            // this only updates the current record and does not refill the grid
27522>>>>>>>>>            Get pbNotifyingExternalDD to bOldGridAction
27523>>>>>>>>>            Set pbNotifyingExternalDD to True
27524>>>>>>>>>            Send Request_Assign of hoServer
27525>>>>>>>>>            Set pbNotifyingExternalDD to bOldGridAction
27526>>>>>>>>>        End
27526>>>>>>>>>>
27526>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
27527>>>>>>>>>            Send ClearGrid
27528>>>>>>>>>        End
27528>>>>>>>>>>
27528>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure 
27529>>>>>>>>>
27529>>>>>>>>>    Function SelectBestColumn Integer iFile Integer iField Returns Integer
27531>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCol iColFile iColField
27531>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bCol
27531>>>>>>>>>        Handle[] hoColumnObjects
27532>>>>>>>>>        
27532>>>>>>>>>        Get phoColumnObjects to hoColumnObjects
27533>>>>>>>>>        For iCol from 0 to (SizeOfArray(hoColumnObjects)-1)
27539>>>>>>>>>>
27539>>>>>>>>>            Get pbIsWebColumn of hoColumnObjects[iCol] to bCol
27540>>>>>>>>>            If (bCol) Begin
27542>>>>>>>>>                Get Data_File of hoColumnObjects[iCol] iCol to iColFile
27543>>>>>>>>>                If iFile Begin
27545>>>>>>>>>                    Get Data_Field of hoColumnObjects[iCol] iCol to iColField
27546>>>>>>>>>                    If (iColFile=iFile and iColField=iField) Begin
27548>>>>>>>>>                        Function_Return iCol
27549>>>>>>>>>                    End
27549>>>>>>>>>>
27549>>>>>>>>>                End
27549>>>>>>>>>>
27549>>>>>>>>>            End
27549>>>>>>>>>>
27549>>>>>>>>>        Loop
27550>>>>>>>>>>
27550>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return -1
27551>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
27552>>>>>>>>>    
27552>>>>>>>>>    Function DragData Returns Variant
27554>>>>>>>>>        tWebListDragData DragData
27554>>>>>>>>>        tWebListDragData DragData
27554>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoJsonData 
27554>>>>>>>>>        
27554>>>>>>>>>        Get phoJsonDragData to hoJsonData
27555>>>>>>>>>        If (hoJsonData <> C_WebUnresolvedObject) Begin
27557>>>>>>>>>            Get JsonToDataType of hoJsonData to DragData
27558>>>>>>>>>        End
27558>>>>>>>>>>
27558>>>>>>>>>        
27558>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return DragData
27559>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
27560>>>>>>>>>    
27560>>>>>>>>>    Function DropData Returns Variant
27562>>>>>>>>>        tWebListDropData DropData
27562>>>>>>>>>        tWebListDropData DropData
27562>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoJsonData
27562>>>>>>>>>        
27562>>>>>>>>>        Get phoJsonDropData to hoJsonData
27563>>>>>>>>>        
27563>>>>>>>>>        If (hoJsonData <> C_WebUnresolvedObject and IsOfJsonType(hoJsonData, jsonTypeObject)) Begin
27565>>>>>>>>>            Set pbRequireAllMembers of hoJsonData to False
27566>>>>>>>>>            Get JsonToDataType of hoJsonData to DropData
27567>>>>>>>>>        End
27567>>>>>>>>>>
27567>>>>>>>>>        
27567>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return DropData
27568>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
27569>>>>>>>>>    
27569>>>>>>>>>    Function SupportsDragAction Integer eAction Returns Boolean
27571>>>>>>>>>        If (eAction = C_WebDragListRow) Begin
27573>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return True
27574>>>>>>>>>        End
27574>>>>>>>>>>
27574>>>>>>>>>        
27574>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return False
27575>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
27576>>>>>>>>>    
27576>>>>>>>>>    Function SupportsDropAction Integer eAction Returns Boolean
27578>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bSupported
27578>>>>>>>>>        
27578>>>>>>>>>        Forward Get SupportsDropAction eAction to bSupported
27580>>>>>>>>>        
27580>>>>>>>>>        If (not(bSupported)) Begin
27582>>>>>>>>>            If (eAction = C_WebDropListRow) Begin
27584>>>>>>>>>                Move True to bSupported
27585>>>>>>>>>            End
27585>>>>>>>>>>
27585>>>>>>>>>        End
27585>>>>>>>>>>
27585>>>>>>>>>        
27585>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bSupported
27586>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
27587>>>>>>>>>
27587>>>>>>>>>    // this exposed so developers can create their own error text
27587>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ReportCacheError
27589>>>>>>>>>        Error DFERR_CANT_REFIND_RECORD C_$InvalidRowInCache
27590>>>>>>>>>>
27590>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
27591>>>>>>>>>
27591>>>>>>>>>    // called when a record in the cache cannot be refound. Most likely this was deleted
27591>>>>>>>>>    // by another user.
27591>>>>>>>>>    // optionally report the error and do a refresh based around the current DD
27591>>>>>>>>>    Procedure HandleCacheError
27593>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bSuppressCacheError
27593>>>>>>>>>        
27593>>>>>>>>>        Get pbSuppressCacheError to bSuppressCacheError
27594>>>>>>>>>        If not bSuppressCacheError Begin 
27596>>>>>>>>>            Send ReportCacheError
27597>>>>>>>>>        End
27597>>>>>>>>>>
27597>>>>>>>>>        // reload the list based on current DD (this may also fail)
27597>>>>>>>>>        Send RefreshListFromDD        
27598>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
27599>>>>>>>>>    
27599>>>>>>>>>    
27599>>>>>>>>>    // This method is received by the Web Control that is the target of a CallAction that is sent
27599>>>>>>>>>    // from the client. Augmented to perform format conversion for parameters passed to OnSearch.
27599>>>>>>>>>    // methods.
27599>>>>>>>>>    Function HandleAction String sAction String[] aParams Handle hoAttachment Returns String
27601>>>>>>>>>        Integer i icParameters iCol
27601>>>>>>>>>        Integer eDataType
27601>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoCol
27601>>>>>>>>>        String sReturnVal
27601>>>>>>>>>        
27601>>>>>>>>>        // Get the parameter count
27601>>>>>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(aParams)) to icParameters
27602>>>>>>>>>        
27602>>>>>>>>>        // Special Case: OnChange
27602>>>>>>>>>        If (Uppercase(sAction) = "ONSEARCH") Begin
27604>>>>>>>>>            // If the action is an OnSearch event then we must test if the data type is a number, 
27604>>>>>>>>>            // Date or DateTime. If so we must convert each parameter value from the universal 
27604>>>>>>>>>            // transfer format
27604>>>>>>>>>            WebGet piSortColumn to iCol
27605>>>>>>>>>    
27605>>>>>>>>>            If (iCol >= 0) Begin
27607>>>>>>>>>                // Query the data type of the current sort column
27607>>>>>>>>>                Get GetColumnObject iCol to hoCol
27608>>>>>>>>>                Get peDataType of hoCol to eDataType
27609>>>>>>>>>                // Note: For efficienty we do not WebGet peDataType! In other words we do not
27609>>>>>>>>>                // get the "synchronized copy of peDataType (if there is one). This is much more
27609>>>>>>>>>                // efficient but it also assumes that a control's peDataType does not change 
27609>>>>>>>>>                // dynamically. This should be OK
27609>>>>>>>>>                
27609>>>>>>>>>                // Send Hook for converting the value to format for transport.
27609>>>>>>>>>                For i from 0 to (icParameters - 1)
27615>>>>>>>>>>
27615>>>>>>>>>                    Move (ConvertFromClient(eDataType, aParams[i])) to aParams[i]
27616>>>>>>>>>                Loop
27617>>>>>>>>>>
27617>>>>>>>>>            End
27617>>>>>>>>>>
27617>>>>>>>>>        End
27617>>>>>>>>>>
27617>>>>>>>>>        
27617>>>>>>>>>        // Now call the superclass's implementation of HandleAction 
27617>>>>>>>>>        Forward Get HandleAction sAction aParams hoAttachment to sReturnVal
27619>>>>>>>>>        
27619>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return sReturnVal
27620>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
27621>>>>>>>>>    
27621>>>>>>>>>    // Augment to make sure LoadDataPage is allowed when the control is disabled as well.
27621>>>>>>>>>    Procedure AllowServerAction Boolean  ByRef bAllow String sMethodName Handle hoMessage Boolean bIsFunction
27623>>>>>>>>>        If (hoMessage = RefProc(LoadDataPage)) Begin
27625>>>>>>>>>            Get IsControlAccessible False True to bAllow
27626>>>>>>>>>        End
27626>>>>>>>>>>
27626>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
27627>>>>>>>>>            Forward Send AllowServerAction (&bAllow) sMethodName hoMessage bIsFunction
27629>>>>>>>>>        End
27629>>>>>>>>>>
27629>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
27630>>>>>>>>>        
27630>>>>>>>>>    // This function is called when serializing the object to client. We augment it here to 
27630>>>>>>>>>    // determine psKeyBuddy object name based on the handle set to phoKeyBuddy.
27630>>>>>>>>>    Procedure PreSerializeObject
27632>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoObj
27632>>>>>>>>>        String sObj
27632>>>>>>>>>        
27632>>>>>>>>>        Get phoKeyBuddy to hoObj
27633>>>>>>>>>        If (hoObj <> C_WebUnresolvedObject) Begin
27635>>>>>>>>>            Get WebObjectName of hoObj to sObj            
27636>>>>>>>>>        End
27636>>>>>>>>>>
27636>>>>>>>>>        Set psKeyBuddy to sObj
27637>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
27638>>>>>>>>>    
27638>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnCreateDefaultHeaderMenu
27640>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bShowHeader bUseHeaderMenuOnWholeList
27640>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoDefaultHeaderMenu hoChild
27640>>>>>>>>>        
27640>>>>>>>>>        Get pbShowHeader to bShowHeader
27641>>>>>>>>>        Get pbUseHeaderMenuOnWholeList to bUseHeaderMenuOnWholeList
27642>>>>>>>>>        
27642>>>>>>>>>        Get CreateNamed of Self (RefClass(cWebContextMenu)) "oDefaultHeaderMenu" to hoDefaultHeaderMenu
27643>>>>>>>>>        Set piWidth of hoDefaultHeaderMenu to 220
27644>>>>>>>>>        Get CreateNamed of hoDefaultHeaderMenu (RefClass(cWebMenuColumnList)) "oColumnList" to hoChild
27645>>>>>>>>>        Get CreateNamed of hoDefaultHeaderMenu (RefClass(cWebMenuColumnRestorer)) "oColumnRestorer" to hoChild
27646>>>>>>>>>        Get CreateNamed of hoDefaultHeaderMenu (RefClass(cWebMenuGroupingSelector)) "oGroupingSelector" to hoChild
27647>>>>>>>>>
27647>>>>>>>>>        If (bShowHeader and not(bUseHeaderMenuOnWholeList)) Begin
27649>>>>>>>>>            Set peContext of hoDefaultHeaderMenu to C_WebUIContextListHead
27650>>>>>>>>>        End
27650>>>>>>>>>>
27650>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
27651>>>>>>>>>            Set peContext of hoDefaultHeaderMenu to C_WebUIContextListFull
27652>>>>>>>>>        End
27652>>>>>>>>>>
27652>>>>>>>>>        
27652>>>>>>>>>        Set phPrivateDefaultHeaderMenu to hoDefaultHeaderMenu
27653>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
27654>>>>>>>>>    
27654>>>>>>>>>    Procedure End_Construct_Object
27656>>>>>>>>>        // Create the default menu if no custom was specified.
27656>>>>>>>>>        If (pbUseCustomHeaderMenu(Self) = False) Begin
27658>>>>>>>>>            Send OnCreateDefaultHeaderMenu
27659>>>>>>>>>        End
27659>>>>>>>>>>
27659>>>>>>>>>        
27659>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send End_Construct_Object
