29522>>>>>>>>>>>>
29522>>>>>>>>>>>        
29522>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iTokenPos > 0) Begin
29524>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (AppendArray(ucResult, CopyArray(parsedata.ucCurrentChunk, parsedata.iChunkRead, iTokenPos - 1))) to ucResult
29525>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (iTokenPos + SizeOfArray(ucToken)) to parsedata.iChunkRead
29526>>>>>>>>>>>        End
29526>>>>>>>>>>>>
29526>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
29527>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (ResizeArray(ucResult, 0)) to ucResult
