29620>>>>>>>>>>>        
29620>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (StringToUCharArray(sBoundary))    to parsedata.ucBoundary
29621>>>>>>>>>>>        Move False                              to parsedata.bAbort
29622>>>>>>>>>>>        Move 0                                  to parsedata.iChunkOffset
29623>>>>>>>>>>>        Move 13 to ucNewLine[0]
29624>>>>>>>>>>>        Move 10 to ucNewLine[1]
29625>>>>>>>>>>>        
