29731>>>>>>>>>// This class is capable of parsing multipart/form-data requests. These requests are used to post
29731>>>>>>>>>// binary data and usually files. The WAF file upload uses this class. Because it works in chunks
29731>>>>>>>>>// are used this class is capable of handling large files. The main implementation is in the
29731>>>>>>>>>// cWebHttpMultipartFormdataHandler_mixin so it can also be used by other classes like
29731>>>>>>>>>// cLocalWebResourceManagerProxy.
29731>>>>>>>>>Class cWebHttpMultipartFormdataHandler is a cWebHttpHandler
