30214>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer    piProvider  PROV_RSA_FULL
30215>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer    piCipher    CALG_RC4
30216>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer    piHash      CALG_MD5
30217>>>>>>>>>>>        
30217>>>>>>>>>>>        // Private properties
30217>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Handle     Private_phProv
30218>>>>>>>>>>>        
30218>>>>>>>>>>>        // Block cipher properties
