30447>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Generates random data.
30447>>>>>>>>>>>    Function GenerateRandom Integer iBytes Returns UChar[]
30449>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hProv
30449>>>>>>>>>>>        UChar[] uaResult
