30497>>>>>>>>>    // User hook to manage what to do when creating a new client/server session. By default
30497>>>>>>>>>    // the system will create a globally unique identifier GUID as a new session key.
30497>>>>>>>>>    // This is called automatically during LoadWebApp and the session key is passed back to the 
30497>>>>>>>>>    // client.
30497>>>>>>>>>    // sRemoteAddress - Is the IP address of the client.
30497>>>>>>>>>    // Returns        - The new session key.
30497>>>>>>>>>    Function CreateSession String sRemoteAddress Returns String
30499>>>>>>>>>        String sSessionKey
30499>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoCryptRandom
30499>>>>>>>>>        Integer iLength
30499>>>>>>>>>        
30499>>>>>>>>>        Get piSessionKeyLength to iLength
30500>>>>>>>>>        
30500>>>>>>>>>        //  Generate a random key (slightly too long)
30500>>>>>>>>>        Get phoRandomizer to hoCryptRandom
30501>>>>>>>>>        Get GenerateRandomString of hoCryptRandom (iLength + 10) to sSessionKey
30502>>>>>>>>>        
30502>>>>>>>>>        //  Clear out special characters as these might cause issues with older browsers and ASP Classic, and then cut to the proper length
30502>>>>>>>>>        Move (Left(Replaces("+", Replaces("/", sSessionKey, ""), ""), iLength)) to sSessionKey
30503>>>>>>>>>        
30503>>>>>>>>>        Set psSessionKey to sSessionKey
30504>>>>>>>>>        
30504>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return sSessionKey
30505>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
