30542>>>>>>>>>    Function ValidateSession String sSessionKey Returns Boolean
30544>>>>>>>>>        If (Length(sSessionKey) = piSessionKeyLength(Self)) Begin
30546>>>>>>>>>            Set psSessionKey to sSessionKey
30547>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return True
30548>>>>>>>>>        End
30548>>>>>>>>>>
30548>>>>>>>>>        
30548>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return False
