30781>>>>>>>    // Returns the full file path of the standard Reportcache target folder of the current workspace.
30781>>>>>>>    // Normally this would be "<home>\Reports\Cache" where <home> is the full path to the workspace's
30781>>>>>>>    // root folder.
30781>>>>>>>    //
30781>>>>>>>    // bCreate - If True and the reports cache folder does not currently exist then the function will
30781>>>>>>>    //           attempt to create that directory. If it is unable to create the directory then
30781>>>>>>>    //           an error is raised and the function will return "". 
30781>>>>>>>    Function GetReportsCache Boolean bCreate Returns String
30783>>>>>>>        Integer iAttributes
30783>>>>>>>        String sPath sHome sSep
30783>>>>>>>        Boolean bOK
30783>>>>>>>
30783>>>>>>>        Move (SysConf(SYSCONF_DIR_SEPARATOR)) to sSep                // i.e. sSep = "\"
30784>>>>>>>        Get psHome of (phoWorkspace(ghoApplication)) to sHome
30785>>>>>>>        
30785>>>>>>>        // Strip trailing "/"
