31082>>>>>>>
31082>>>>>>>// Handler for server-side web properties (WebProperty=Server and WebProperty=ServerSession). The
31082>>>>>>>// base class contains the logic for storing these in memory. At first access they are loaded from 
31082>>>>>>>// a store (cWebServerPropStore, usually the database) and at the end of a request they are written
31082>>>>>>>// to the store. This class handles the logic for determining the key and serializing to / from a 
31082>>>>>>>// JSON string passed along as UChar array.
31082>>>>>>>//
31082>>>>>>>
31082>>>>>>>Class cWebServerPropHandler is a cWebBasePropHandler
31083>>>>>>>    
31083>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
31085>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
31087>>>>>>>        
31087>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbSessionScope False
31088>>>>>>>        
31088>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbLoaded False
31089>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbChanged False
31090>>>>>>>        
31090>>>>>>>        Property Integer piGenKeyLength 64
31091>>>>>>>        
31091>>>>>>>        Property Handle phoRandomizer -1
31092>>>>>>>        Property Handle phoJsonParser -1
31093>>>>>>>        
31093>>>>>>>        Set pbErrorObjNotFound to False
31094>>>>>>>        
31094>>>>>>>        Object oRandomGen is a cCryptographerEx
31096>>>>>>>            Set phoRandomizer to Self
31097>>>>>>>        End_Object
31098>>>>>>>        
31098>>>>>>>        Object oJsonParser is a cJsonObject
31100>>>>>>>            Set phoJsonParser to Self
31101>>>>>>>            Set pbUseVariantMetaData to True
31102>>>>>>>            Set pbRequireAllMembers to False
31103>>>>>>>        End_Object
31104>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
