31310>>>>>>>    //
31310>>>>>>>    // Special logic for when a view is loaded. When loading a view the client can already have web
31310>>>>>>>    // properties being webset and they are passed to the server. This function makes sure they are
31310>>>>>>>    // passed back to client as if they where just set by marking all of the properties of the 
31310>>>>>>>    // passed view as changed.
31310>>>>>>>    //
31310>>>>>>>    Procedure ProcessLoadViewClientSyncProps Handle hoView
31312>>>>>>>        // Analyses all of the sync properties passed in the request and stored in gaSyncProps. If any of these properties belong to
31312>>>>>>>        // the passed hoView object or a child of hoView, then they are transferred to gaSyncChangedProps. This has the effect of
31312>>>>>>>        // marking the property as changed during the AJAX Call so the values will be sent back to the client.
31312>>>>>>>        //
31312>>>>>>>        // This is used by LoadView to ensure that any cached sync property values of the loaded view that were passed to the server
31312>>>>>>>        // will be passed back to the client so that the client will consider them to have been WebSet during the call and will apply
31312>>>>>>>        // the property changes. This forms part of our support for caching WebSet property changes of views that have never been
31312>>>>>>>        // loaded on the client.
31312>>>>>>>        Integer iObject icObject iTo iStoreIndex
31312>>>>>>>        Integer iProperty   icProperty
31312>>>>>>>        Handle hoObject hoWebNeighborhood
31312>>>>>>>        
31312>>>>>>>        Get piStoreIndex to iStoreIndex
31313>>>>>>>        
31313>>>>>>>        // Iterate the web properties. We are looking for objects that match hoView or are
31313>>>>>>>        // child objects of hoView....
31313>>>>>>>        Get piSize to icObject
31314>>>>>>>        
31314>>>>>>>        For iObject from 0 to (icObject - 1)
31320>>>>>>>>
31320>>>>>>>            Get phoWebNeighborhood of gaSyncObjectHandles[iStoreIndex][iObject] to hoWebNeighborhood
31321>>>>>>>            
31321>>>>>>>            If (hoWebNeighborhood = hoView) Begin
31323>>>>>>>                // Mark all web properties of this object as changed....
31323>>>>>>>                Move True to gaSyncChangedProps[iStoreIndex][iObject].bContainsChanges     // Mark the object as changed
31324>>>>>>>                
31324>>>>>>>                // Iterate the properties of this object....
31324>>>>>>>                Move (SizeOfArray(gaSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iObject].aP)) to icProperty
31325>>>>>>>                
31325>>>>>>>                For iProperty from 0 to (icProperty - 1)
31331>>>>>>>>
31331>>>>>>>                    Move iProperty to gaSyncChangedProps[iStoreIndex][iObject].aiIndex[iProperty]
31332>>>>>>>                Loop
31333>>>>>>>>
31333>>>>>>>            End
31333>>>>>>>>
31333>>>>>>>        Loop
31334>>>>>>>>
31334>>>>>>>        
31334>>>>>>>        
31334>>>>>>>        //  Iterate all advanced web properties to mark them as changed as well
31334>>>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex]) - 1) to iTo
31335>>>>>>>        For iProperty from 0 to iTo
31341>>>>>>>>
31341>>>>>>>            Get phoWebNeighborhood of gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProperty].hoObj to hoWebNeighborhood
31342>>>>>>>            If (hoWebNeighborhood = hoView) Begin
31344>>>>>>>                Move True to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProperty].bChanged
31345>>>>>>>            End
31345>>>>>>>>
31345>>>>>>>            
31345>>>>>>>        Loop
31346>>>>>>>>
31346>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
