31353>>>>>>>        Move (ResizeArray(gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex], iSize)) to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex]
31354>>>>>>>        
31354>>>>>>>        For iProp from 0 to (iSize - 1)
31360>>>>>>>>
31360>>>>>>>            Get FindWebObject of hoLocator aAdvSyncProps[iProp].sO to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProp].hoObj
31361>>>>>>>            Move False                  to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProp].bChanged
31362>>>>>>>            Move False                  to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProp].bDeserialized
31363>>>>>>>            Move 0                      to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProp].tSvrProp.vV
31364>>>>>>>            Move aAdvSyncProps[iProp]   to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProp].tSyncProp
31365>>>>>>>        Loop
31366>>>>>>>>
31366>>>>>>>        
31366>>>>>>>        Forward Send InitializeSyncProps aSyncProps
31368>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
