31453>>>>>>>>>    // rather than trying to integrate it directly into Error_Report. It gets called by
31453>>>>>>>>>    // Error_Report as needed.
31453>>>>>>>>>    Procedure BasicErrorReport Integer iError Integer iLine String ErrMsg
31455>>>>>>>>>        String sSystemErr sMess sLabel sFile sDtl sFullError
