31459>>>>>>>>>        // caption is passed in the error text. This handler does not support setting the caption so we just remove it.
31459>>>>>>>>>        // The ajax superclass handler will support this
31459>>>>>>>>>        If (iError=DFERR_OPERATOR) Begin
31461>>>>>>>>>            Move (pos(C_ErrorCaption,ErrMsg)) to iSrc
31462>>>>>>>>>            If iSrc Begin
31464>>>>>>>>>                Move (length(C_ErrorCaption)) to  iTxtLen
31465>>>>>>>>>                Move (remove(ErrMsg, 1, iSrc-1 + iTxtLen )) to sCaption // will not get used here
31466>>>>>>>>>                Move (Left(ErrMsg,iSrc-1)) to ErrMsg
31467>>>>>>>>>            End
31467>>>>>>>>>>
31467>>>>>>>>>        End
31467>>>>>>>>>>
31467>>>>>>>>>        
31467>>>>>>>>>        Get Error_Description iError ErrMsg  to sSystemErr
