31667>>>>>>>>>    //
31667>>>>>>>>>    // Enumerate all errors.
31667>>>>>>>>>    // For each error send iMsg to hObj passing all required error
31667>>>>>>>>>    // information: iErr#, sErrorMsg, iLine, iFile, iField
31667>>>>>>>>>    //
31667>>>>>>>>>    Procedure EnumerateErrors Integer iMsg Integer hObj
31669>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCount i
31669>>>>>>>>>        Get ErrorCount to iCount
31670>>>>>>>>>        Decrement iCount
31671>>>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to iCount
31677>>>>>>>>>>
31677>>>>>>>>>            Send ErrorReportCallback i iMsg hObj
31678>>>>>>>>>        Loop
31679>>>>>>>>>>
31679>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
31680>>>>>>>>>    
31680>>>>>>>>>    // if item is -1 it is last error
31680>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ErrorReportCallback Integer iItem Integer iMsg Integer hObj
31682>>>>>>>>>        String  sErrMsg
31682>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFileNr iFieldNr iErrNr iLineNr
31682>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCount
31682>>>>>>>>>        Get ErrorCount to iCount
31683>>>>>>>>>        If (iItem=-1) ;            Move (iCount-1) to iItem // if -1, use last error
31686>>>>>>>>>        If (iItem>=0 and iCount>iItem) Begin
31688>>>>>>>>>            Get Error_ErrNr   iItem to iErrNr
31689>>>>>>>>>            Get Error_ErrMsg  iItem to sErrMsg
31690>>>>>>>>>            Get Error_LineNr  iItem to iLineNr
31691>>>>>>>>>            Get Error_FileNr  iItem to iFileNr
31692>>>>>>>>>            Get Error_FieldNr iItem to iFieldNr
31693>>>>>>>>>            Send iMsg to hObj iErrNr sErrMsg iLineNr iFileNr iFieldNr
31694>>>>>>>>>        End
31694>>>>>>>>>>
31694>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
31695>>>>>>>>>    
31695>>>>>>>>>    // this is used to remove a single error from the queue
31695>>>>>>>>>    // if iItem is -1, last error
31695>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ClearError Integer iItem
31697>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCount
31697>>>>>>>>>        Get ErrorCount to iCount
31698>>>>>>>>>        If (iItem=-1) ;            Move (iCount-1) to iItem // if -1, use last error
31701>>>>>>>>>        If (iItem>=0 and iCount>iItem) Begin
31703>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Item iItem
31704>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Item to oErrorText iItem
31705>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Item to oLineNr    iItem
31706>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Item to oFileNr    iItem
31707>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Item to oFieldNr   iItem
31708>>>>>>>>>        End
31708>>>>>>>>>>
31708>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
