31742>>>>>>>>>    // see if error exists for this file and field. If it does, return the
31742>>>>>>>>>    // item number, else return -1.
31742>>>>>>>>>    Function FileFieldErrorItem Integer iFile Integer iField Returns Integer
31744>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCount i
