31762>>>>>// WebApp wrapper object. Each AJAX WebApp must have one and only one cWebApp object. 
31762>>>>>// The webapp object is used as a container for...
31762>>>>>// - The application's commandbar/titlebar (menubar, toolbars, breadcrumb etc)
31762>>>>>// - Each cWebView and cWebModalDialog
31762>>>>>//
31762>>>>>// Adds interface for:
31762>>>>>// - Loading the WebApp
31762>>>>>// - General handling web service requests,
31762>>>>>// - Registering web service objects (cWebView etc),
31762>>>>>// - Locating cWebControl objects (i.e. retreiving the object handle of any cWebControl),
31762>>>>>// - Managing client-server web properties,
31762>>>>>// - Show/Hide View interface.
31762>>>>>// - Height & width properties.
31762>>>>>// - cWebUIObject support (via mixin)
31762>>>>>// 
31762>>>>>
31762>>>>>
