31997>>>>>>>    Procedure AfterAttachDDO
31999>>>>>>>        // Sent after each DEO Object has been attached to its DDO server and had all the DDO field settings
31999>>>>>>>        // applied to its published properties. We will set default values to any cWebControl properties that
31999>>>>>>>        // are still unassigned...
31999>>>>>>>        String sChecked sUnchecked
31999>>>>>>>        
31999>>>>>>>        // Set default values for any unassigned properties
31999>>>>>>>        Forward Send AfterAttachDDO
32001>>>>>>>        
32001>>>>>>>        Get psChecked to sChecked
32002>>>>>>>        Get psUnchecked to sUnchecked
32003>>>>>>>        
32003>>>>>>>        // If both values are unassigned (null) then set them to default values.
32003>>>>>>>        If (Trim(sChecked) = "" and Trim(sUnchecked) = "") Begin
32005>>>>>>>            Set psChecked to "1"
32006>>>>>>>            Set psUnchecked to "0"
32007>>>>>>>        End
32007>>>>>>>>
32007>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
