32448>>>>>>>>>    Procedure SuggestionsFindIncremental String sSearch tSuggestion[] ByRef aSuggestions
32450>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField iIndex iLen iRow iMax eType iLength iDec
32450>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
32450>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bContinue bCase bOldRelate bNeedsRelate
32450>>>>>>>>>        String sVal sLowSearch
32450>>>>>>>>>        RowID riTest
32450>>>>>>>>>        
32450>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
32451>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File  to iFile
32452>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField       
32453>>>>>>>>>        
32453>>>>>>>>>        If ((hoServer <> 0) and (iFile <> 0)) Begin
32455>>>>>>>>>            Get piFindIndex to iIndex
32456>>>>>>>>>            WebGet piMaxResults to iMax
32457>>>>>>>>>            WebGet pbCaseSensitive to bCase
32458>>>>>>>>>            
32458>>>>>>>>>            Get_Attribute DF_FIELD_TYPE of iFile iField to eType
32461>>>>>>>>>            Get_Attribute DF_FIELD_LENGTH of iFile iField to iLength
32464>>>>>>>>>            Get_Attribute DF_FIELD_PRECISION of iFile iField to iDec
32467>>>>>>>>>            
32467>>>>>>>>>            Move (iLength - iDec) to iLength
32468>>>>>>>>>            
32468>>>>>>>>>            If (iIndex <= 0) Begin
32470>>>>>>>>>                Get_Attribute DF_FIELD_INDEX of iFile iField to iIndex
32473>>>>>>>>>            End
32473>>>>>>>>>>
32473>>>>>>>>>            
32473>>>>>>>>>            If (iIndex > 0) Begin
32475>>>>>>>>>                Get No_Relate_State of hoServer to bOldRelate
32476>>>>>>>>>                Get DDOConstraintNeedsRelate of hoServer iIndex to bNeedsRelate
32477>>>>>>>>>                Set No_Relate_State of hoServer to (not(bNeedsRelate))
32478>>>>>>>>>                                
32478>>>>>>>>>                Move True to bContinue
32479>>>>>>>>>                Move (Length(sSearch)) to iLen
32480>>>>>>>>>                Move (Lowercase(sSearch)) to sLowSearch
32481>>>>>>>>>                Move 0 to iRow
32482>>>>>>>>>                
32482>>>>>>>>>                //  Find first record
32482>>>>>>>>>                Send Request_Read of hoServer FIRST_RECORD iFile iIndex
32483>>>>>>>>>                Set_Field_Value iFile iField to sSearch
32486>>>>>>>>>                Send Request_Read of hoServer GE iFile iIndex
32487>>>>>>>>>                
32487>>>>>>>>>                While (Found and bContinue)
32491>>>>>>>>>                    Get_Field_Value iFile iField to sVal
32494>>>>>>>>>                    
32494>>>>>>>>>                    If ((not(bCase) and Lowercase(Left(sVal, iLen)) = sLowSearch) or (bCase and Left(sVal, iLen) = sSearch)) Begin
32496>>>>>>>>>
32496>>>>>>>>>                        Move (SerializeRowID(GetRowID(iFile)))  to aSuggestions[iRow].sRowId
32497>>>>>>>>>                        Move (Trim(sVal))                       to aSuggestions[iRow].aValues[0]
32498>>>>>>>>>                        Increment iRow
32499>>>>>>>>>                        
32499>>>>>>>>>                        Move (iRow < iMax) to bContinue
32500>>>>>>>>>                       
32500>>>>>>>>>                        Send Request_Read of hoServer GT iFile iIndex  
32501>>>>>>>>>                    End
32501>>>>>>>>>>
32501>>>>>>>>>                    Else Begin
32502>>>>>>>>>
32502>>>>>>>>>                        Move False to bContinue
32503>>>>>>>>>                        If (eType = DF_BCD and Length(sSearch) < iLength) Begin
32505>>>>>>>>>                            Move (GetRowID(iFile)) to riTest
32506>>>>>>>>>                            
32506>>>>>>>>>                            Repeat
32506>>>>>>>>>>
32506>>>>>>>>>                                Move (sSearch + "0") to sSearch
32507>>>>>>>>>                                If (Length(sSearch) >= iLength) ;                                    Break
32510>>>>>>>>>                                
32510>>>>>>>>>                                Set_Field_Value iFile iField to sSearch
32513>>>>>>>>>                                Send Request_Read of hoServer GE iFile iIndex
32514>>>>>>>>>                                Move (not(IsSameRowID(riTest, GetRowID(iFile)))) to bcontinue
32515>>>>>>>>>                            Until (bcontinue)
32517>>>>>>>>>                        End
32517>>>>>>>>>>
32517>>>>>>>>>                    End
32517>>>>>>>>>>
32517>>>>>>>>>                Loop
32518>>>>>>>>>>
32518>>>>>>>>>                Set No_Relate_State of hoServer to bOldRelate
32519>>>>>>>>>            End
32519>>>>>>>>>>
32519>>>>>>>>>        End
32519>>>>>>>>>>
32519>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
32520>>>>>>>>>
32520>>>>>>>>>    Procedure SuggestionsFindFullText String sSearch tSuggestion[] ByRef aSuggestions
32522>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField iIndex iRow iMax
32522>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
32522>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bContinue bCase  bOldRelate bNeedsRelate
32522>>>>>>>>>        String sVal sLowSearch
32522>>>>>>>>>        
32522>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
32523>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File  to iFile
32524>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField       
32525>>>>>>>>>        
32525>>>>>>>>>        If ((hoServer <> 0) and (iFile <> 0)) Begin
32527>>>>>>>>>            WebGet piMaxResults to iMax
32528>>>>>>>>>            WebGet pbCaseSensitive to bCase
32529>>>>>>>>>            
32529>>>>>>>>>            Get piFindIndex to iIndex
32530>>>>>>>>>            If (iIndex <= 0) Begin
32532>>>>>>>>>                Get_Attribute DF_FIELD_INDEX of iFile iField to iIndex
32535>>>>>>>>>            End
32535>>>>>>>>>>
32535>>>>>>>>>            
32535>>>>>>>>>            Get No_Relate_State of hoServer to bOldRelate
32536>>>>>>>>>            Get DDOConstraintNeedsRelate of hoServer iIndex to bNeedsRelate
32537>>>>>>>>>            Set No_Relate_State of hoServer to (not(bNeedsRelate))
32538>>>>>>>>>            
32538>>>>>>>>>            
32538>>>>>>>>>            Move (Lowercase(sSearch)) to sLowSearch
32539>>>>>>>>>            Move True to bContinue
32540>>>>>>>>>            Move 0 to iRow
32541>>>>>>>>>                
32541>>>>>>>>>            //  Find first record
32541>>>>>>>>>            Send Request_Read of hoServer FIRST_RECORD iFile iIndex
32542>>>>>>>>>            
32542>>>>>>>>>            While (Found and (iRow < iMax))
32546>>>>>>>>>                Get_Field_Value iFile iField to sVal
32549>>>>>>>>>                
32549>>>>>>>>>                If ((bCase and sVal contains sSearch) or (not(bCase) and Lowercase(sVal) contains sLowSearch) or sSearch = "") Begin
32551>>>>>>>>>                    Move (SerializeRowID(GetRowID(iFile)))  to aSuggestions[iRow].sRowId
32552>>>>>>>>>                    Move (Trim(sVal))                       to aSuggestions[iRow].aValues[0]
32553>>>>>>>>>                    Increment iRow
32554>>>>>>>>>                End
32554>>>>>>>>>>
32554>>>>>>>>>                
32554>>>>>>>>>                Send Request_Read of hoServer GT iFile iIndex 
32555>>>>>>>>>            Loop
32556>>>>>>>>>>
32556>>>>>>>>>            Set No_Relate_State of hoServer to bOldRelate
32557>>>>>>>>>        End
32557>>>>>>>>>>
32557>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
32558>>>>>>>>>    
32558>>>>>>>>>    Procedure SuggestionsSQLFullText String sSearch tSuggestion[] ByRef aSuggestions
32560>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField iIndex iRow iMax
32560>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
32560>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bContinue bOrigActive  bOldRelate bNeedsRelate
32560>>>>>>>>>        String sVal sOrigFilter sFilter sFile sField
32560>>>>>>>>>        
32560>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
32561>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File  to iFile
32562>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField       
32563>>>>>>>>>        
32563>>>>>>>>>        If ((hoServer <> 0) and (iFile <> 0)) Begin
32565>>>>>>>>>            
32565>>>>>>>>>            // make sure we send DD messages to owner DDO
32565>>>>>>>>>            Get Which_Data_Set of hoServer iFile to hoServer
32566>>>>>>>>>            If (hoServer=0) Begin
32568>>>>>>>>>                Procedure_Return
32569>>>>>>>>>            End
32569>>>>>>>>>>
32569>>>>>>>>>            
32569>>>>>>>>>            WebGet piMaxResults to iMax
32570>>>>>>>>>            Get piFindIndex to iIndex
32571>>>>>>>>>            If (iIndex <= 0) Begin
32573>>>>>>>>>                Get_Attribute DF_FIELD_INDEX of iFile iField to iIndex
32576>>>>>>>>>            End
32576>>>>>>>>>>
32576>>>>>>>>>            
32576>>>>>>>>>            //  Determine current filter settings
32576>>>>>>>>>            Get psSQLFilter of hoServer to sOrigFilter
32577>>>>>>>>>            Get pbUseDDSqlFilters of hoServer to bOrigActive
32578>>>>>>>>>            
32578>>>>>>>>>            // generate the Like filter string
32578>>>>>>>>>            Get SQLStrLike of hoServer iField sSearch to sFilter
32579>>>>>>>>>            // If filtering was active append this to what's there
32579>>>>>>>>>            If (bOrigActive) Begin
32581>>>>>>>>>                Get SQLStrAppend of hoServer sOrigFilter sFilter to sFilter
32582>>>>>>>>>            End
32582>>>>>>>>>>
32582>>>>>>>>>            
32582>>>>>>>>>            //  Set filter
32582>>>>>>>>>            Set psSQLFilter of hoServer to sFilter
32583>>>>>>>>>            Set pbUseDDSqlFilters of hoServer to True
32584>>>>>>>>>            
32584>>>>>>>>>            
32584>>>>>>>>>            // this will optimize No_relate. If your DF constraint does not
32584>>>>>>>>>            // need a post-relate test, we will disabled relates for this
32584>>>>>>>>>            Get No_Relate_State of hoServer to bOldRelate
32585>>>>>>>>>            Get DDOConstraintNeedsRelate of hoServer iIndex to bNeedsRelate
32586>>>>>>>>>            Set No_Relate_State of hoServer to (not(bNeedsRelate))
32587>>>>>>>>>
32587>>>>>>>>>            //  Find records
32587>>>>>>>>>            Move True to bContinue
32588>>>>>>>>>            Move 0 to iRow
32589>>>>>>>>>            
32589>>>>>>>>>            Send Request_Read of hoServer FIRST_RECORD iFile iIndex
32590>>>>>>>>>            
32590>>>>>>>>>            While (bContinue)
32594>>>>>>>>>                Get_Field_Value iFile iField to sVal
32597>>>>>>>>>                
32597>>>>>>>>>                If (Found) Begin // and ((bCase and sVal contains sSearch) or (not(bCase) and Lowercase(sVal) contains sLowSearch))) Begin
32599>>>>>>>>>                    Move (SerializeRowID(GetRowID(iFile)))  to aSuggestions[iRow].sRowId
32600>>>>>>>>>                    Move (Trim(sVal))                       to aSuggestions[iRow].aValues[0]
32601>>>>>>>>>                    Increment iRow
32602>>>>>>>>>                    
32602>>>>>>>>>                    Move (iRow < iMax) to bContinue
32603>>>>>>>>>                   
32603>>>>>>>>>                    Send Request_Read of hoServer GT iFile iIndex 
32604>>>>>>>>>                End
32604>>>>>>>>>>
32604>>>>>>>>>                Else Begin
32605>>>>>>>>>                    Move False to bContinue
32606>>>>>>>>>                End
32606>>>>>>>>>>
32606>>>>>>>>>                
32606>>>>>>>>>            Loop
32607>>>>>>>>>>
32607>>>>>>>>>            
32607>>>>>>>>>            //  Restore filters
32607>>>>>>>>>            Set psSQLFilter of hoServer to sOrigFilter
32608>>>>>>>>>            Set pbUseDDSqlFilters of hoServer to bOrigActive
32609>>>>>>>>>            Set No_Relate_State of hoServer to bOldRelate
32610>>>>>>>>>        End
32610>>>>>>>>>>
32610>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
32611>>>>>>>>>    
32611>>>>>>>>>    Procedure SuggestionsValidation String sSearch tSuggestion[] ByRef aSuggestions Boolean bFullText
32613>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer hoTable
32613>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField iRow iCount iFound iMax iLen
32613>>>>>>>>>        Variant[][] aData
32614>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bCaseSensitive bContinue
32614>>>>>>>>>        String sDescr sVal
32614>>>>>>>>>        
32614>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
32615>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File  to iFile
32616>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField       
32617>>>>>>>>>        
32617>>>>>>>>>        If ((hoServer <> 0) and (iFile <> 0)) Begin
32619>>>>>>>>>            Get File_Field_Table_Object of hoServer iFile iField to hoTable
32620>>>>>>>>>            If (hoTable <> 0) Begin
32622>>>>>>>>>                Get tabledata of hoTable to aData
32623>>>>>>>>>        
32623>>>>>>>>>                WebGet piMaxResults to iMax
32624>>>>>>>>>                WebGet pbCaseSensitive to bCaseSensitive  
32625>>>>>>>>>            
32625>>>>>>>>>                If (not(bCaseSensitive)) Begin
32627>>>>>>>>>                    Move (Lowercase(sSearch)) to sSearch
32628>>>>>>>>>                End
32628>>>>>>>>>>
32628>>>>>>>>>                
32628>>>>>>>>>                
32628>>>>>>>>>                Move (SizeOfArray(aData)) to iCount
32629>>>>>>>>>                Move 0 to iRow
32630>>>>>>>>>                Move (Length(sSearch)) to iLen
32631>>>>>>>>>                Move True to bContinue
32632>>>>>>>>>                
32632>>>>>>>>>            
32632>>>>>>>>>                While (iFound < iMax and iRow < iCount and bContinue)
32636>>>>>>>>>                    If (not(bCaseSensitive)) Begin
32638>>>>>>>>>                        Move (Lowercase(aData[iRow][0])) to sVal
32639>>>>>>>>>                        Move (Lowercase(aData[iRow][1])) to sDescr
32640>>>>>>>>>                    End
32640>>>>>>>>>>
32640>>>>>>>>>                    Else Begin
32641>>>>>>>>>                        Move aData[iRow][0] to sVal
32642>>>>>>>>>                        Move aData[iRow][1] to sDescr
32643>>>>>>>>>                    End
32643>>>>>>>>>>
32643>>>>>>>>>                    
32643>>>>>>>>>                    If ((bFullText and (sVal contains sSearch)) or (not(bFullText) and (Left(sVal, iLen) = sSearch))) Begin
32645>>>>>>>>>                        Move aData[iRow][0] to aSuggestions[iFound].sRowId
32646>>>>>>>>>                        Move aData[iRow][0] to aSuggestions[iFound].aValues[0]
32647>>>>>>>>>                        Move aData[iRow][1] to aSuggestions[iFound].aValues[1]
32648>>>>>>>>>                        Increment iFound
32649>>>>>>>>>                    End
32649>>>>>>>>>>
32649>>>>>>>>>                    Else Begin
32650>>>>>>>>>                        Move (bFullText or iFound = 0) to bContinue
32651>>>>>>>>>                    End
32651>>>>>>>>>>
32651>>>>>>>>>                    
32651>>>>>>>>>                    Increment iRow
32652>>>>>>>>>                Loop
32653>>>>>>>>>>
32653>>>>>>>>>            End
32653>>>>>>>>>>
32653>>>>>>>>>        End
32653>>>>>>>>>>
32653>>>>>>>>>         
32653>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
32654>>>>>>>>>    
32654>>>>>>>>>    
32654>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnFindSuggestions String sSearch tSuggestion[] ByRef aSuggestions
32656>>>>>>>>>        Integer iMode iFile
32656>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bFullText bResult bSupportsSQL
32656>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
32656>>>>>>>>>        
32656>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
32657>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File  to iFile
32658>>>>>>>>>        
32658>>>>>>>>>        If ((hoServer <> 0) and (iFile <> 0)) Begin
32660>>>>>>>>>            
32660>>>>>>>>>            WebGet peSuggestionMode to iMode
32661>>>>>>>>>            WebGet pbFullText to bFullText
32662>>>>>>>>>            
32662>>>>>>>>>            If (iMode = smFind) Begin
32664>>>>>>>>>                If (not(bFullText)) Begin
32666>>>>>>>>>                    Send SuggestionsFindIncremental sSearch (&aSuggestions)
32667>>>>>>>>>                End
32667>>>>>>>>>>
32667>>>>>>>>>                Else Begin
32668>>>>>>>>>                    Get SupportsSQLFilters of hoServer to bSupportsSQL
32669>>>>>>>>>                    If (bSupportsSQL) Begin
32671>>>>>>>>>                        Send SuggestionsSQLFullText sSearch (&aSuggestions)
32672>>>>>>>>>                    End
32672>>>>>>>>>>
32672>>>>>>>>>                    Else Begin
32673>>>>>>>>>                        Send SuggestionsFindFullText sSearch (&aSuggestions)
32674>>>>>>>>>                    End
32674>>>>>>>>>>
32674>>>>>>>>>                End
32674>>>>>>>>>>
32674>>>>>>>>>            End
32674>>>>>>>>>>
32674>>>>>>>>>            Else If (iMode = smValidationTable) Begin
32677>>>>>>>>>                Send SuggestionsValidation sSearch (&aSuggestions) bFullText
32678>>>>>>>>>            End
32678>>>>>>>>>>
32678>>>>>>>>>        End
32678>>>>>>>>>>
32678>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
