32691>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnSelectSuggestion String sSearch tSuggestion Suggestion
32693>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
32693>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField iMode
32693>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bFind bSuccess
32693>>>>>>>>>        RowID rRowId
32693>>>>>>>>>        
32693>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
32694>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File  to iFile
32695>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField       
32696>>>>>>>>>        
32696>>>>>>>>>        If ((hoServer <> 0) and (iFile <> 0)) Begin
32698>>>>>>>>>            WebGet peSuggestionMode to iMode
32699>>>>>>>>>            
32699>>>>>>>>>            If (iMode = smFind) Begin
32701>>>>>>>>>                Get pbFindOnSelect to bFind
32702>>>>>>>>>                If (bFind) Begin
32704>>>>>>>>>                    Move (DeserializeRowID(Suggestion.sRowId)) to rRowId    
32705>>>>>>>>>                    
32705>>>>>>>>>                    If (not(IsNullRowID(rRowId))) Begin
32707>>>>>>>>>                        Get FindByRowIdEx of hoServer iFile rRowId to bSuccess
32708>>>>>>>>>                        // this is very unlikely
32708>>>>>>>>>                        If not bSuccess Begin
32710>>>>>>>>>                            Error DFERR_CANT_REFIND_RECORD
32711>>>>>>>>>>
32711>>>>>>>>>                        End
32711>>>>>>>>>>
32711>>>>>>>>>                    End
32711>>>>>>>>>>
32711>>>>>>>>>                End
32711>>>>>>>>>>
32711>>>>>>>>>                Else Begin
32712>>>>>>>>>                    WebSet psValue to Suggestion.aValues[0]
32713>>>>>>>>>                    WebSet pbChanged to True
32714>>>>>>>>>                End
32714>>>>>>>>>>
32714>>>>>>>>>            End
32714>>>>>>>>>>
32714>>>>>>>>>            Else If (imode = smValidationTable) Begin
32717>>>>>>>>>                WebSet psValue to Suggestion.sRowId
32718>>>>>>>>>                WebSet pbChanged to True
32719>>>>>>>>>            End
32719>>>>>>>>>>
32719>>>>>>>>>            
32719>>>>>>>>>        End
32719>>>>>>>>>>
32719>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
