33660>>>>>>>    Procedure privateOnSelectEvent Integer iEvent
33662>>>>>>>        tWebRow Row
33662>>>>>>>        tWebRow Row
33662>>>>>>>        Handle hoJson
33662>>>>>>>        Get phoActionJsonData to hoJson
33663>>>>>>>        Case Begin
33663>>>>>>>            Case (iEvent = 1) // C_WEBLIST_MULTI_SELECT_SINGLE
33665>>>>>>>                Get JsonToDataType of hoJson to Row
33666>>>>>>>                Send OnSelectRow Row
33667>>>>>>>                Case Break
33668>>>>>>>            Case (iEvent = 2) // C_WEBLIST_MULTI_DESELECT_SINGLE
33671>>>>>>>                Get JsonToDataType of hoJson to Row
33672>>>>>>>                Send OnDeSelectRow Row
33673>>>>>>>                Case Break
33674>>>>>>>            Case (iEvent = 3) // C_WEBLIST_MULTI_SELECT_ALL
33677>>>>>>>                WebSet pbAllSelected to True
33678>>>>>>>                Send OnSelectAllRows
33679>>>>>>>                Case Break
33680>>>>>>>            Case (iEvent = 4) // C_WEBLIST_MULTI_DESELECT_ALL
33683>>>>>>>                WebSet pbAllSelected to False
33684>>>>>>>                Send OnDeSelectAllRows
33685>>>>>>>                Case Break
33686>>>>>>>        Case End
33686>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
