33780>>>>>>>    
33780>>>>>>>    // Sent by DDO when there is a clear/find/save/delete.
33780>>>>>>>    //
33780>>>>>>>    // eMode - Determines the type of DDO operation which generated this refresh message. 
33780>>>>>>>    //         It may be one of the following:
33780>>>>>>>    //         Mode_Clear:             Used only for DEOs attached to the DDO that was the
33780>>>>>>>    //                                 "origin" of a Clear operation, (i.e., the DDO received
33780>>>>>>>    //                                 the original Clear message). All other DDOs Send their 
33780>>>>>>>    //                                 DEOs the refresh message passing mode_find_or_clear_set.  
33780>>>>>>>    //         Mode_Find_or_Clear_Set: Used for DEOs attached to DDOs which have Found and/or cleared records.  
33780>>>>>>>    //         Mode_Clear_All:         Used for DEOs attached to any DDO that participated in a clear_all operation.  
33780>>>>>>>    //         Mode_Delete:            Used for DEOs attached to any DDO that performed a successful deletion. 
33780>>>>>>>    //                                 DDOs that were merely updated as the result of a deletion Use Mode_Find_or_Clear_Set.  
33780>>>>>>>    //         Mode_Save:              Used for DEOs attached to any DDO involved in a successful Save operation. 
33780>>>>>>>    Procedure Refresh Integer eMode
33782>>>>>>>        Boolean bActive bAppSynching bClearSelectionOnRefresh bRowDisplay
33782>>>>>>>        
33782>>>>>>>        Get Active_State to bActive
33783>>>>>>>        Get AppSynching to bAppSynching
33784>>>>>>>        Get pbPrivateClearSelectionOnRefresh to bClearSelectionOnRefresh
33785>>>>>>>        Get pbNotifyingExternalDD to bRowDisplay
33786>>>>>>>
33786>>>>>>>        If (bActive and not(bAppSynching) and bClearSelectionOnRefresh and not(bRowDisplay)) Begin
33788>>>>>>>            If (eMode = MODE_CLEAR or eMode = Mode_Find_or_Clear_Set or eMode = MODE_CLEAR_ALL) Begin
33790>>>>>>>                Send ClearListSelection
33791>>>>>>>            End
33791>>>>>>>>
33791>>>>>>>        End
33791>>>>>>>>
33791>>>>>>>        Forward Send Refresh eMode
33793>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
33794>>>>>>>    
33794>>>>>>>    // Abstracted to disable selection-clearing if just searching for text.
