33796>>>>>>>        Boolean bPrivateClearSelectionOnRefresh
33796>>>>>>>        Get pbPrivateClearSelectionOnRefresh to bPrivateClearSelectionOnRefresh
33797>>>>>>>        
33797>>>>>>>        Set pbPrivateClearSelectionOnRefresh to False
33798>>>>>>>        Forward Send OnSearch sSearchText
33800>>>>>>>        Set pbPrivateClearSelectionOnRefresh to bPrivateClearSelectionOnRefresh
33801>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
