34030>>>>>>>        // If you want to do something else, like hide it, use OnChangeRights
34030>>>>>>>        Get LoadViewOnClickHandle to hoView
34031>>>>>>>        Get pbAutoEnable to bAutoEnable
34032>>>>>>>        
