38072>>>>>>>
38072>>>>>>>    // START Client events
38072>>>>>>>    
38072>>>>>>>    Procedure ReceiveEventData String sEventName String sId
38074>>>>>>>        Handle hoJson
38074>>>>>>>        tWebDrawingEventData eventData
38074>>>>>>>        tWebDrawingEventData eventData
38074>>>>>>>
38074>>>>>>>        Get phoActionJsonData to hoJson
38075>>>>>>>        Get JsonToDataType of hoJson to eventData
38076>>>>>>>        
38076>>>>>>>        Case Begin
38076>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseClick")
38078>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseClick sId eventData
38079>>>>>>>                Case Break
38080>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseDoubleClick")
38083>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseDoubleClick sId eventData
38084>>>>>>>                Case Break
38085>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseUp")
38088>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseUp sId eventData
38089>>>>>>>                Case Break
38090>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseDown")
38093>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseDown sId eventData
38094>>>>>>>                Case Break
38095>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseDrag")
38098>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseDrag sId eventData
38099>>>>>>>                Case Break
38100>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseEnter")
38103>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseEnter sId eventData
38104>>>>>>>                Case Break
38105>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseLeave")
38108>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseMove sId eventData
38109>>>>>>>                Case Break
38110>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseMove")
38113>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseMove sId eventData
38114>>>>>>>                Case Break
38115>>>>>>>        Case End
38115>>>>>>>        
38115>>>>>>>        Send UpdateDrawing
38116>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
38117>>>>>>>
38117>>>>>>>    Procedure HandleResize
38119>>>>>>>        Handle hoJson
38119>>>>>>>        tWebDrawingResizetData resizeEventData
38119>>>>>>>        tWebDrawingResizetData resizeEventData
38119>>>>>>>
38119>>>>>>>        Get phoActionJsonData to hoJson
38120>>>>>>>        Get JsonToDataType of hoJson to resizeEventData
38121>>>>>>>
38121>>>>>>>        Send OnResize resizeEventData
38122>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
38123>>>>>>>
38123>>>>>>>    // END Client events
