39224>>>>>    Function CreateSession String sRemoteAddress Returns String
39226>>>>>        String sSessionKey
39226>>>>>        Integer iErr
39226>>>>>        Boolean bLogWebSession
39226>>>>>        Handle hoSessionDD       
39226>>>>>        Get phoSessionDD to hoSessionDD
39227>>>>>        
39227>>>>>        //  Get session key
39227>>>>>        Forward Get CreateSession sRemoteAddress to sSessionKey
39229>>>>>        
39229>>>>>        Get pbLogWebSession to bLogWebSession
39230>>>>>        If not bLogWebSession Begin
39232>>>>>            Function_Return sSessionKey        
39233>>>>>        End
39233>>>>>>
39233>>>>>
39233>>>>>        //  Store session
39233>>>>>        Send Clear of hoSessionDD
