39316>>>>>    Function CreatePasswordHash String sPassword String ByRef sHash Returns Boolean
39318>>>>>        If (not(pbPasswordHashing(Self))) Begin
39320>>>>>            Move sPassword to sHash
39321>>>>>            Function_Return True
39322>>>>>        End
39322>>>>>>
39322>>>>>        
39322>>>>>        If (not(CreatePasswordHash(phoCrypto(Self), sPassword, &sHash))) Begin
39324>>>>>            Function_Return False
39325>>>>>        End
39325>>>>>>
39325>>>>>        Move ("V1$" + sHash) to sHash
39326>>>>>        Function_Return True
