39328>>>>>    Function VerifyPasswordHash String sUserPassword String sEnteredPassword Boolean ByRef bShouldUpgrade Returns Boolean
39330>>>>>        If (not(pbPasswordHashing(Self))) Begin
39332>>>>>            If (num_arguments > 2) Move False to bShouldUpgrade
39335>>>>>            Function_Return (sUserPassword = sEnteredPassword)
39336>>>>>        End
39336>>>>>>
39336>>>>>        
39336>>>>>        String sVersion
39336>>>>>        Move (Left(sUserPassword, 3)) to sVersion
39337>>>>>        If (sVersion = "V1$") Begin
39339>>>>>            If (num_arguments > 2) Move False to bShouldUpgrade
39342>>>>>            Function_Return (VerifyPasswordHash(phoCrypto(Self), sEnteredPassword, Right(sUserPassword, Length(sUserPassword) - 3)))
39343>>>>>        End
39343>>>>>>
39343>>>>>        Else Begin
39344>>>>>            If (num_arguments > 2) Move True to bShouldUpgrade
39347>>>>>            Function_Return False
39348>>>>>        End
39348>>>>>>
39348>>>>>    End_Function
