39452>>>>>    //
39452>>>>>    // This procedure is called when validating a session and after logging in. Its purpose is to 
39452>>>>>    // update properties based on the session and user data. Augment this function to update 
39452>>>>>    // properties based on the session / user table. Note that WebAppUser and WebAppSession contain
39452>>>>>    // the right records when this procedure is called.
39452>>>>>    //
39452>>>>>    // Params:
