40733>>>>>        
40733>>>>>        If (((Amt + Customer.Purchases) < 999999) and ((Amt + Customer.Balance) < 999999)) Begin
40735>>>>>            Add Amt to Customer.Purchases
40736>>>>>            Add Amt to Customer.Balance
40737>>>>>        End
40737>>>>>>
40737>>>>>        Else Begin
40738>>>>>            Send UserError ("The value of" * FormatCurrency(Amt + Customer.Purchases, 2) * "exceeds the maximum amount allowed for customer purchases." * ;                 "Review your order to adjust prices and quantities to be within the limit of" * FormatCurrency(999999, 2)) "Error in updating Customer"
40739>>>>>        End
