41394>>>>>    
41394>>>>>    // Update and Backout need to adjust the Inventory.On_Hand quantity,
41394>>>>>    // the OrderDetail line's extended price and the OrderHeader total.
41394>>>>>    // We will call the same procedure (Adjust_Balances) to insure that
41394>>>>>    // Backout and Update are inverses of each other.
41394>>>>>    // Note that Backout does not need to change the Extended_Price.
41394>>>>>    // This only gets changed as part of Update.
41394>>>>>    Procedure Update
41396>>>>>        Forward Send Update
41398>>>>>        Move (OrderDetail.Price * OrderDetail.Qty_Ordered) to OrderDetail.Extended_Price
41399>>>>>        Send Adjust_Balances OrderDetail.Qty_Ordered OrderDetail.Extended_Price
41400>>>>>    End_Procedure
41401>>>>>    
41401>>>>>    Procedure Backout
41403>>>>>        Forward Send Backout
41405>>>>>        Send Adjust_Balances (-OrderDetail.Qty_Ordered) (-OrderDetail.Extended_Price)
41406>>>>>    End_Procedure
41407>>>>>    
41407>>>>>    // Called by Backout and Update, passing the quantity and the extended price.
41407>>>>>    // Subtract quantity from on-hand Inventory and add extended Amt to order total.
41407>>>>>    Procedure Adjust_Balances Number Qty Number Amt
41409>>>>>        Subtract Qty from Inventory.On_Hand
41410>>>>>        Add      Amt to   OrderHeader.Order_Total
41411>>>>>    End_Procedure
41412>>>>>    
41412>>>>>    // when entering the price field we may wish to update the
41412>>>>>    // current field value with the standard unit price from the Inventory table.
41412>>>>>    // Only do this if the current amount is zero and an item was actually picked.
41412>>>>>    // If non-zero or no item picked, we assume the field is being edited (and we make no assumptions).
41412>>>>>    Procedure Entering_Price Integer Field# Number nAmnt
41414>>>>>        Handle hoInventoryDD
41414>>>>>        Boolean bHasRecord
41414>>>>>        
41414>>>>>        Get Data_Set Inventory.File_Number to hoInventoryDD
41415>>>>>        
41415>>>>>        If (hoInventoryDD) Begin
41417>>>>>            Get HasRecord of hoInventoryDD to bHasRecord
41418>>>>>            
41418>>>>>            If (nAmnt=0 and bHasRecord) Begin
41420>>>>>                Get File_Field_Current_Value File_Field Inventory.Unit_Price to nAmnt
41421>>>>>                Set Field_Changed_Value Field# to nAmnt
41422>>>>>                Send Adjust_Display_Total
41423>>>>>            End
41423>>>>>>
41423>>>>>        End
41423>>>>>>
41423>>>>>        
41423>>>>>    End_Procedure
41424>>>>>    
41424>>>>>    // This updates the extended price field, which will update any display balances.
41424>>>>>    // This is only done for display purposes.
41424>>>>>    // The actual amount is updated to the field during the save.
41424>>>>>    Procedure Adjust_Display_total Integer iField String sValue
41426>>>>>        Integer iQty
41426>>>>>        Number  nAmnt
41426>>>>>        
41426>>>>>        Get Field_Current_Value Field OrderDetail.Qty_Ordered    to iQty
41427>>>>>        Get Field_Current_Value Field OrderDetail.Price          to nAmnt
41428>>>>>        Set Field_Current_Value Field OrderDetail.Extended_Price to (nAmnt * iQty)
41429>>>>>        // note we set value, but not changed_state!
41429>>>>>    End_Procedure
41430>>>>>    
41430>>>>>    Procedure Field_Defaults
41432>>>>>        Forward Send Field_Defaults
41434>>>>>        Set Field_Changed_Value Field OrderDetail.Qty_Ordered to 1
41435>>>>>    End_Procedure
