42249>>>                If (not(bSynching)) Begin
42251>>>                    Get IsViewReadOnly to bReadOnly
42252>>>                    WebSet pbEnabled to (not(bReadOnly) and HasRecord(oSalesPersonDataDictionary))
42253>>>                End
42253>>>>
42253>>>
42253>>>            End_Procedure
