43650>>>>>>>>>        
43650>>>>>>>>>        // Get all config props
43650>>>>>>>>>        
43650>>>>>>>>>        Get GetConfigurableProps to aProps
43651>>>>>>>>>        
43651>>>>>>>>>        Move ((SizeOfArray(aProps)) - 1) to iProps
43652>>>>>>>>>        
43652>>>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to iProps
43658>>>>>>>>>>
43658>>>>>>>>>            Delegate Get TruncateName aProps[i].sObjName to sDynamicObjectId
43660>>>>>>>>>            If (sDynamicObjectId <> "") Begin
