43664>>>>>>>>>                
43664>>>>>>>>>                Get DynamicObject sDynamicObjectId to hoObj
43665>>>>>>>>>            End
43665>>>>>>>>>>
43665>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
43666>>>>>>>>>                Move (Self) to hoObj
43667>>>>>>>>>            End
43667>>>>>>>>>>
43667>>>>>>>>>            
43667>>>>>>>>>            If (hoObj <> 0) Begin
43669>>>>>>>>>                Move EmptyValue to CurValue
43670>>>>>>>>>                
43670>>>>>>>>>                Get FindWebPropertyMetaByName of hoObj aProps[i].sPropName to PropMeta
43671>>>>>>>>>                If (PropMeta.hmGetter <> 0) Begin
43673>>>>>>>>>                    Get GetSyncProp of hoObj hoObj PropMeta.hmSetter PropMeta.sName to vValue
43674>>>>>>>>>                    
