45099>>>>>    Function CompareStartDateByFilterType String sFilter Returns DateTime
45102>>>>>        DateTime dtToday dtStartDate dtJan4 dtThisWeekStart dtWeek1Monday
45102>>>>>        Integer iYear iMonth iDayOfWeek iWeek
45102>>>>>        
45102>>>>>        Move (CurrentDateTime()) to dtToday
45103>>>>>        
45103>>>>>        Case Begin
45103>>>>>            Case (sFilter = "year")
45105>>>>>                Move ((DateGetYear(dtToday)) - 1) to iYear
45106>>>>>                Move (DateSet(iYear, 1, 1)) to dtStartDate
45107>>>>>                Case Break
45108>>>>>            Case (sFilter = "month")
45111>>>>>                Move (DateGetYear(dtToday) - 1) to iYear
45112>>>>>                Move (DateGetMonth(dtToday)) to iMonth
45113>>>>>                Move (DateSet(iYear, iMonth, 1)) to dtStartDate
45114>>>>>                Case Break
45115>>>>>            Case (sFilter = "week")
45118>>>>>                Move (DateGetDayofWeekISO(dtToday)) to iDayOfWeek
45119>>>>>                Move (DateAddDay(dtToday, - (iDayOfWeek - 1))) to dtThisWeekStart
45120>>>>>                Move (DateGetWeekOfYearISO(dtThisWeekStart)) to iWeek
45121>>>>>                Move (DateGetYear(dtToday) - 1) to iYear
45122>>>>>                Move (DateSet(iYear, 1, 4)) to dtJan4
45123>>>>>                Move (DateAddDay(dtJan4, - (DateGetDayOfWeekISO(dtJan4) - 1))) to dtWeek1Monday
45124>>>>>                Move (DateAddDay(dtWeek1Monday, (iWeek - 1) * 7)) to dtStartDate
45125>>>>>                Case Break
45126>>>>>            Case (sFilter = "last_year")
45129>>>>>                Move ((DateGetYear(dtToday)) - 2) to iYear
45130>>>>>                Move (DateSet(iYear, 1, 1)) to dtStartDate
45131>>>>>                Case Break
45132>>>>>            Case (sFilter = "last_month")
45135>>>>>                Move (DateAddMonth(dtToday, - 1)) to dtStartDate
45136>>>>>                Move (DateAddYear(dtStartDate, - 1)) to dtStartDate
45137>>>>>                Move (DateSet(DateGetYear(dtStartDate), DateGetMonth(dtStartDate), 1)) to dtStartDate
45138>>>>>                Case Break
45139>>>>>            Case (sFilter = "last_week")
45142>>>>>                Move (DateGetDayofWeekISO(dtToday)) to iDayOfWeek
45143>>>>>                Move (DateAddDay(dtToday, - (iDayOfWeek - 1))) to dtThisWeekStart
45144>>>>>                Move (DateAddDay(dtThisWeekStart, -7)) to dtThisWeekStart
45145>>>>>                Move (DateGetWeekOfYearISO(dtThisWeekStart)) to iWeek
45146>>>>>                Move (DateGetYear(dtToday) - 1) to iYear
45147>>>>>                Move (DateSet(iYear, 1, 4)) to dtJan4
45148>>>>>                Move (DateAddDay(dtJan4, - (DateGetDayOfWeekISO(dtJan4) - 1))) to dtWeek1Monday
45149>>>>>                Move (DateAddDay(dtWeek1Monday, (iWeek - 1) * 7)) to dtStartDate
45150>>>>>                Case Break
45151>>>>>        Case End
45151>>>>>        
45151>>>>>        Function_Return dtStartDate
45152>>>>>    End_Function
