45191>>>>>    Function FullCompareEndDateByFilterType String sFilter Returns DateTime
45194>>>>>        DateTime dtStart dtEnd
45194>>>>>    
45194>>>>>        Get CompareStartDateByFilterType sFilter to dtStart
45195>>>>>    
45195>>>>>        Case Begin
