45197>>>>>                Move (DateSet(DateGetYear(dtStart), 12, 31)) to dtEnd
45198>>>>>                Case Break
45199>>>>>    
45199>>>>>            Case (sFilter = "month")
45202>>>>>                // End = first day of next month - 1 day
45202>>>>>                Move (DateAddMonth(dtStart, 1)) to dtEnd
45203>>>>>                Move (DateAddDay(dtEnd, -1)) to dtEnd
45204>>>>>                Case Break
45205>>>>>    
45205>>>>>            Case (sFilter = "week")
45208>>>>>                Move (DateAddDay(dtStart, 6)) to dtEnd
45209>>>>>                Case Break
45210>>>>>    
45210>>>>>            Case (sFilter = "last_year")
45213>>>>>                Move (DateSet(DateGetYear(dtStart), 12, 31)) to dtEnd
45214>>>>>                Case Break
45215>>>>>    
45215>>>>>            Case (sFilter = "last_month")
45218>>>>>                Move (DateAddMonth(dtStart, 1)) to dtEnd
45219>>>>>                Move (DateAddDay(dtEnd, -1)) to dtEnd
45220>>>>>                Case Break
45221>>>>>    
45221>>>>>            Case (sFilter = "last_week")
45224>>>>>                Move (DateAddDay(dtStart, 6)) to dtEnd
45225>>>>>                Case Break
45226>>>>>        Case End
45226>>>>>    
45226>>>>>        Function_Return dtEnd
45227>>>>>    End_Function
