45334>>>>>>>>>>>// This function formats the time in a picture-string passed
45334>>>>>>>>>>>//
45334>>>>>>>>>>>// Picture  Meaning
45334>>>>>>>>>>>//
45334>>>>>>>>>>>//    h     Hours with no leading zero for single-digit hours; 12-hour clock
45334>>>>>>>>>>>//    hh    Hours with leading zero for single-digit hours; 12-hour clock
45334>>>>>>>>>>>//    H     Hours with no leading zero for single-digit hours; 24-hour clock
45334>>>>>>>>>>>//    HH    Hours with leading zero for single-digit hours; 24-hour clock
45334>>>>>>>>>>>//    m     Minutes with no leading zero for single-digit minutes
45334>>>>>>>>>>>//    mm    Minutes with leading zero for single-digit minutes
45334>>>>>>>>>>>//    s     Seconds with no leading zero for single-digit seconds
45334>>>>>>>>>>>//    ss    Seconds with leading zero for single-digit seconds
45334>>>>>>>>>>>//    t     One character time marker string, such as A or P
45334>>>>>>>>>>>//    tt    Multicharacter time marker string, such as AM or PM
45334>>>>>>>>>>>//
45334>>>>>>>>>>>// For example, to get the time string
45334>>>>>>>>>>>//    "11:29:40 PM"
45334>>>>>>>>>>>// use the following picture string:
