45669>>>>>>>>>    Function LocaleFormatDateTime DateTime dtIn WString wsLocaleName WString wsFormat Returns String
45671>>>>>>>>>        tWinSystemTime SystemTimeIn
45671>>>>>>>>>        tWinSystemTime SystemTimeIn
45671>>>>>>>>>        Integer iDataLength
45671>>>>>>>>>        WString wsFormattedValue
45671>>>>>>>>>
45671>>>>>>>>>        Get DateTimeToSystemTime dtIn to SystemTimeIn
45672>>>>>>>>>        Move (WinAPI_GetDateFormatEx (AddressOf (wsLocaleName), 0, AddressOf (SystemTimeIn), AddressOf (wsFormat), 0, 0, 0)) to iDataLength
45673>>>>>>>>>        Move (ZeroString (iDataLength)) to wsFormattedValue
45674>>>>>>>>>        Move (WinAPI_GetDateFormatEx (AddressOf (wsLocaleName), 0, AddressOf (SystemTimeIn), AddressOf (wsFormat), AddressOf (wsFormattedValue), iDataLength, 0)) to iDataLength
45675>>>>>>>>>
45675>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return wsFormattedValue
45676>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
