46015>>>>>>>>>
46015>>>>>>>>>    Function TransitionDateTime tWinSystemTime TransitionTimeIn Returns String
46017>>>>>>>>>        String sFormattedTime sFormattedDate sDayName
46017>>>>>>>>>        Integer iRetval iDayIdentifier iDecimalSeparator
46017>>>>>>>>>
46017>>>>>>>>>        If (TransitionTimeIn.wHour > 0 or TransitionTimeIn.wMinute > 0) Begin
46019>>>>>>>>>            Get FormatSystemTimeToTime TransitionTimeIn to sFormattedTime
46020>>>>>>>>>            If (TransitionTimeIn.wMilliseconds > 0) Begin
46022>>>>>>>>>                Get_Attribute DF_DECIMAL_SEPARATOR to iDecimalSeparator
46025>>>>>>>>>                Move (sFormattedTime + Character (iDecimalSeparator) + Cast (TransitionTimeIn.wMilliseconds, String)) to sFormattedTime
46026>>>>>>>>>            End
46026>>>>>>>>>>
46026>>>>>>>>>        End
46026>>>>>>>>>>
46026>>>>>>>>>        If (TransitionTimeIn.wYear <> 0) Begin
46028>>>>>>>>>            Get FormatSystemTimeToDate TransitionTimeIn to sFormattedDate
46029>>>>>>>>>        End
46029>>>>>>>>>>
46029>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
46030>>>>>>>>>            Case Begin
46030>>>>>>>>>                Case (TransitionTimeIn.wMonth < 13 and TransitionTimeIn.wMonth >= 1)
46032>>>>>>>>>                    Get LocaleMonthName of oLocaleInfoHandler (TransitionTimeIn.wMonth - 1 + LOCALE_SABBREVMONTHNAME1) to sFormattedDate
46033>>>>>>>>>                    Case Break
46034>>>>>>>>>                Case (TransitionTimeIn.wMonth = 13)
46037>>>>>>>>>                    Get LocaleMonthName of oLocaleInfoHandler LOCALE_SABBREVMONTHNAME13 to sFormattedDate
46038>>>>>>>>>                    Case Break
46039>>>>>>>>>                Case Else
46039>>>>>>>>>                    // No month information so no date
46039>>>>>>>>>            Case End
46039>>>>>>>>>            If (TransitionTimeIn.wDay >= 1) Begin
46041>>>>>>>>>                Case Begin
46041>>>>>>>>>                    Case (TransitionTimeIn.wDay = 1)
46043>>>>>>>>>                        Move (sFormattedDate * Cast (TransitionTimeIn.wDay, String) + "st") to sFormattedDate
46044>>>>>>>>>                        Case Break
46045>>>>>>>>>                    Case (TransitionTimeIn.wDay = 2)
46048>>>>>>>>>                        Move (sFormattedDate * Cast (TransitionTimeIn.wDay, String) + "nd") to sFormattedDate
46049>>>>>>>>>                        Case Break
46050>>>>>>>>>                    Case (TransitionTimeIn.wDay = 3)
46053>>>>>>>>>                        Move (sFormattedDate * Cast (TransitionTimeIn.wDay, String) + "rd") to sFormattedDate
46054>>>>>>>>>                        Case Break
46055>>>>>>>>>                    Case (TransitionTimeIn.wDay = 4)
46058>>>>>>>>>                        Move (sFormattedDate * Cast (TransitionTimeIn.wDay, String) + "th") to sFormattedDate
46059>>>>>>>>>                        Case Break
46060>>>>>>>>>                    Case (TransitionTimeIn.wDay = 5)
46063>>>>>>>>>                        Move (sFormattedDate * "last") to sFormattedDate
