46880>>>>>                    Break
46881>>>>>                Case (sAction = "OrdersQuery")
46884>>>>>                    WebSet psCaption of oButton to "Orders Query"
46885>>>>>                    Break
46886>>>>>                Case (sAction = "SalesPersonQuery")
46889>>>>>                    WebSet psCaption of oButton to "SalesPerson Query"
46890>>>>>                    Break
46891>>>>>                Case (sAction = "NewCustomer")
46894>>>>>                    WebSet psCaption of oButton to "New Customer"
46895>>>>>                    Break
46896>>>>>                Case (sAction = "NewOrder")
46899>>>>>                    WebSet psCaption of oButton to "New Order"
46900>>>>>                    Break
46901>>>>>                Case (sAction = "ProductQuery")
46904>>>>>                    WebSet psCaption of oButton to "Product Query"
46905>>>>>                    Break
46906>>>>>                Case Else
46906>>>>>                    Error DFERR_PROGRAM "Unimplemented action"
46907>>>>>>
46907>>>>>            Case End
46907>>>>>        End
46907>>>>>>
46907>>>>>        
46907>>>>>        WebSet psBackgroundColor of oButton to sButtonColor
46908>>>>>    End_Procedure
