50316>>>>>        Procedure OnManualLoadData tWebRow[] ByRef aTheRows String ByRef sCurrentRowID
50319>>>>>            Handle hoTable
50319>>>>>            Integer iRow iCount
50319>>>>>            Variant[][] aData
50320>>>>>            String sTitle
50320>>>>>            
50320>>>>>            Get phoValTable to hoTable
50321>>>>>            Get psSeedValue to sCurrentRowID
50322>>>>>            
50322>>>>>            // the DD knows the name of this validation table, use it.
50322>>>>>            Get Table_Title of hoTable to sTitle
50323>>>>>            Send SetBreadCrumbCaption sTitle
50324>>>>>            
50324>>>>>            Get TableData of hoTable to aData
50325>>>>>            Move (SizeOfArray(aData)) to iCount
50326>>>>>            For iRow from 0 to (iCount-1)
50332>>>>>>
50332>>>>>                Move aData[iRow][0] to aTheRows[iRow].sRowID
50333>>>>>                Move aData[iRow][0] to aTheRows[iRow].aCells[0].sValue
50334>>>>>                Move aData[iRow][1] to aTheRows[iRow].aCells[1].sValue
50335>>>>>            Loop
50336>>>>>>
50336>>>>>        End_Procedure
