51759>>>                Set piColumnSpan to 0
51760>>>                Set psHtml to "The <b>cWebGeoLocation</b> class can track the location using the <i>navigator.geolocation.watchPosition</i> browser API. This is controlled by <b>pbTracking</b>, <b>pbAutoStart</b> & <b>pbAutoStop</b> or the <b>Start</b> and <b>Stop</b> messages. When tracking is enabled the <b>OnLocationChange</b> event will fire whenever the browser indicates a new location. Click the button below to start tracking the current location."
