52577>>>>>>>
52577>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
52579>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
52581>>>>>>>        Send RegisterComEvents
52582>>>>>>>
52582>>>>>>>        
52582>>>>>>>        // If set true, then the control will attempt to bind the value property in the object to the
52582>>>>>>>        // comValue in the control. It will try to keep these values in synch at all times. This allows a
52582>>>>>>>        // control to be used as a Form style value control. the default is true. Even when true if the
52582>>>>>>>        // get/set ComValue methods are not set up to do anything, this will do nothing.
52582>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbBindValue True
52583>>>>>>>        
52583>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
