54039>>>
54039>>>// This example webview is the first part of the simple customerlist report. Users can make selections here. The results
54039>>>// are shown in a second webview. This is done to give the maximum space for the results in a webview.
54039>>>
54039>>>// The controls in this select webview allow selection of a customer number range (from-to customer number) or a customer
54039>>>// name range (from-to partial customer name). Users can also indicate the sort order of the list.
54039>>>
54039>>>// The run report button in the webview will be hidden when running from a mobile device such as a tablet or phone. Running
54039>>>// a report is then possible via the run button in the actionbar.
54039>>>
54039>>>// All selection criteria and options are passed to the results view via the NamedValues member of the NavigateData parameter
54039>>>// of the OnGetNavigateForwardData event
54039>>>
54039>>>Object oCustomerListReportSelect is a cWebView
54041>>>    Set psCaption to "CustomerList"
54042>>>    Set pbShowCaption to False
54043>>>    Set peWebViewStyle to wvsDrillDown
54044>>>    Set psStateViewName to "CustomerListSelect"
54045>>>
54045>>>    Object oWebMainPanel is a cWebPanel
54047>>>        Set piColumnCount to 12
54048>>>
54048>>>        Object oCustomerCustomerNumberGroup is a cWebGroup
54050>>>            Set psCaption to "Customer Number:"
54051>>>            Set piColumnCount to 12
54052>>>            Set piColumnSpan to 3
54053>>>
54053>>>            WebSetResponsive piColumnSpan rmTabletPortrait to 5
54054>>>
54054>>>            WebSetResponsive psCaption rmMobilePortrait to "Number"
54055>>>
54055>>>            Object oFromCustomerCustomerNumber is a cWebForm
54057>>>                Set piColumnSpan to 4
54058>>>                Set peLabelPosition to lpTop
54059>>>                Set peLabelAlign to alignLeft
54060>>>                Set psLabel to "From:"
54061>>>                Set psToolTip to "Enter/select the First Customer in the Selection."
54062>>>                Set peDatatype to typeNumber
54063>>>                Set piMaxLength to 10
54064>>>                Set pbPromptButton to True
54065>>>
54065>>>                WebSetResponsive piColumnSpan rmMobilePortrait to 0
54066>>>                WebSetResponsive piColumnSpan rmTablet to 6
54067>>>
54067>>>                WebRegisterPath ntNavigateForward oSelectCustomer Self "FromCustomerNumber"
54073>>>
54073>>>                Procedure OnPrompt
54076>>>                    Send NavigatePath
54077>>>                End_Procedure
54078>>>
54078>>>                Procedure OnGetNavigateForwardData tWebNavigateData ByRef NavigateData Handle hoToView
54081>>>                    Move nfFromChild to NavigateData.eNavigateType
54082>>>                End_Procedure
54083>>>
