54412>>>>>>>    Function DefaultPrinter Returns String
54414>>>>>>>        WString wPrinterName
54414>>>>>>>        Integer iBufferSize
54414>>>>>>>        Boolean bSuccess
54414>>>>>>>
54414>>>>>>>        Move 0 to iBufferSize
54415>>>>>>>        Move (DR_WinAPI_GetDefaultPrinter (0, AddressOf (iBufferSize))) to bSuccess
54416>>>>>>>        If (not (bSuccess)) Begin
54418>>>>>>>            Move (ZeroString (iBufferSize)) to wPrinterName
54419>>>>>>>            Move (DR_WinAPI_GetDefaultPrinter (AddressOf (wPrinterName), AddressOf (iBufferSize))) to bSuccess
54420>>>>>>>        End
54420>>>>>>>>
54420>>>>>>>
54420>>>>>>>        Function_Return wPrinterName
54421>>>>>>>    End_Function
