54430>>>>>>>        If (sPrinterName <> "") Begin
54432>>>>>>>            // Free previously allocated memory
54432>>>>>>>            Send FreeAllocatedGlobalMemory
54433>>>>>>>
54433>>>>>>>            Move 0 to hPrinter
54434>>>>>>>            Move sPrinterName to wPrinterName
54435>>>>>>>            Move (DR_WinAPI_OpenPrinter (AddressOf (wPrinterName), AddressOf (hPrinter), 0)) to iResult
