55432>>>>>>>        Move START_PAGE_GENERAL to pd.nStartPage
55433>>>>>>>
55433>>>>>>>        Move (CopyMemory (hPrintDlg, AddressOf (pd), SizeOfType (PRINTDLGEXW))) to iVoid
55434>>>>>>>        Set phPrintDlg to hPrintDlg
55435>>>>>>>
