55821>>>>>    // Uses optional error information and return it as error message text, then reset the function error information
55821>>>>>    // to avoid its information is used again
55821>>>>>    Function FormatFunctionErrorMessage Returns String
55823>>>>>        String sReportName sFunctionName sErrMsg
55823>>>>>        tDRFunctionErrorInfo FunctionErrorInfo FunctionErrorReset
55823>>>>>        tDRFunctionErrorInfo FunctionErrorInfo FunctionErrorReset
55823>>>>>
55823>>>>>        Get pFunctionErrorInfo to FunctionErrorInfo
55824>>>>>        If (FunctionErrorInfo.sReportId <> "") Begin
55826>>>>>            Get ComReportName FunctionErrorInfo.sReportId to sReportName
55827>>>>>            Get psFunctionName FunctionErrorInfo.sReportId FunctionErrorInfo.iFunctionId to sFunctionName
55828>>>>>            If (sFunctionName = "") Begin
55830>>>>>                Move C_$DRBuiltInFunction to sFunctionName
55831>>>>>            End
55831>>>>>>
55831>>>>>            Move (SFormat (C_$DRFunctionError, sFunctionName, sReportName, FunctionErrorInfo.sError)) to sErrMsg
55832>>>>>        End
55832>>>>>>
55832>>>>>
55832>>>>>        Function_Return sErrMsg
55833>>>>>    End_Function
