56899>>>>>
56899>>>>>        Get FilterCount sReportId to iFilters
56900>>>>>        If (iFilters > 0) Begin
56902>>>>>            Decrement iFilters
56903>>>>>            For iFilter from 0 to iFilters
56909>>>>>>
56909>>>>>                Get psFilterField sReportId iFilter to sFilterField
56910>>>>>                Move (Mid (sFilterField, Length(sFilterField) - 2, 2)) to sFilterField
56911>>>>>                If (sInfo <> '') Begin
56913>>>>>                    Move (sInfo + "+Chr(10)+") to sInfo
56914>>>>>                End
56914>>>>>>
56914>>>>>                Get peFilterOperator sReportId iFilter to eFilterOperator
56915>>>>>                Get psFilterValue sReportId iFilter to sFilterValue
56916>>>>>                Move (sInfo + Sformat ("'%1 %2 %3'", sFilterField, Mid ("= <>> >=< <=", 2, eFilterOperator - 1 * 2 + 1), sFilterValue)) to sInfo
56917>>>>>            Loop
56918>>>>>>
56918>>>>>        End
