56943>>>>>    Function FindFilterId String sReportId String sFilterField C_drOperators eFilterOperator String sFilterValue Returns Integer
56945>>>>>        Integer iFilters iFilter eReportFilterOperator
56945>>>>>        String sReportFilterField sReportFilterValue
56945>>>>>
56945>>>>>        Send RedirectErrorsToLocalHandler True
56946>>>>>
56946>>>>>        If (sReportId = C_USEMAINDRREPORTID) Begin
56948>>>>>            Get psReportId to sReportId
56949>>>>>        End
56949>>>>>>
56949>>>>>
56949>>>>>        If (sReportId <> "") Begin
56951>>>>>            Get FilterCount sReportId to iFilters
56952>>>>>            If (iFilters > 0) Begin
56954>>>>>                Decrement iFilters
56955>>>>>                For iFilter from 0 to iFilters
56961>>>>>>
56961>>>>>                    Get psFilterField sReportId iFilter to sReportFilterField
56962>>>>>                    If (Uppercase (sReportFilterField) = Uppercase (sFilterField)) Begin
56964>>>>>                        If (num_arguments > 2) Begin
56966>>>>>                            Get peFilterOperator sReportId iFilter to eReportFilterOperator
56967>>>>>                            If (eReportFilterOperator = eFilterOperator) Begin
56969>>>>>                                If (num_arguments > 3) Begin
56971>>>>>                                    Get psFilterValue sReportId iFilter to sReportFilterValue
56972>>>>>                                    If (sReportFilterValue = sFilterValue) Begin
56974>>>>>                                        Send RedirectErrorsToLocalHandler False
56975>>>>>                                        Function_Return iFilter
56976>>>>>                                    End
56976>>>>>>
56976>>>>>                                End
56976>>>>>>
56976>>>>>                                Else Begin
56977>>>>>                                    Send RedirectErrorsToLocalHandler False
56978>>>>>                                    Function_Return iFilter
56979>>>>>                                End
56979>>>>>>
56979>>>>>                            End
56979>>>>>>
56979>>>>>                        End
56979>>>>>>
56979>>>>>                        Else Begin
56980>>>>>                            Send RedirectErrorsToLocalHandler False
56981>>>>>                            Function_Return iFilter
56982>>>>>                        End
56982>>>>>>
56982>>>>>                    End
56982>>>>>>
56982>>>>>                Loop
56983>>>>>>
56983>>>>>            End
56983>>>>>>
56983>>>>>        End
56983>>>>>>
56983>>>>>        Else Begin
56984>>>>>            Error DFERR_DATAFLEX_REPORTS C_$DRNoReportIdSpecified
56985>>>>>>
56985>>>>>        End
56985>>>>>>
56985>>>>>
56985>>>>>        Send RedirectErrorsToLocalHandler False
56986>>>>>
56986>>>>>        Function_Return -1
56987>>>>>    End_Function
