57105>>>>>    Function GenerateReport Returns String
57107>>>>>        String sReportId sFile
57107>>>>>        Boolean bCanceled
57107>>>>>
57107>>>>>        Get OpenReport to sReportId
57108>>>>>        If (sReportId <> "") Begin
57110>>>>>            Get ReportCacheFileName ".pdf" to sFile
57111>>>>>            If (sFile <> "") Begin
57113>>>>>                Send ExportReport C_DRPDF sFile
57114>>>>>            End
57114>>>>>>
57114>>>>>
57114>>>>>            // see if report ran ok, if not return empty path
57114>>>>>            Get pbCanceled to bCanceled
57115>>>>>            If bCanceled Begin
57117>>>>>                Move "" to sFile
57118>>>>>            End
57118>>>>>>
57118>>>>>
57118>>>>>            Send CloseReport sReportId
57119>>>>>        End
57119>>>>>>
57119>>>>>
57119>>>>>        Function_Return sFile
57120>>>>>    End_Function
