57121>>>>>    Procedure GenerateReport
57123>>>>>        String sFile sUrl
57123>>>>>        Handle hoReportViewer
57123>>>>>        Integer eBrowserTarget
57123>>>>>        Boolean bExists
57123>>>>>
57123>>>>>        Get GenerateReport to sFile
57124>>>>>        If (sFile <> "") Begin
57126>>>>>            File_Exist sFile bExists
57127>>>>>            If (bExists) Begin
57129>>>>>                Get DownloadURL of ghoWebResourceManager sFile to sUrl
57130>>>>>                If (sUrl <> "") Begin
57132>>>>>                    Get phoReportViewer to hoReportViewer
57133>>>>>                    If (hoReportViewer <> 0) Begin
57135>>>>>                        WebSet psUrl of hoReportViewer to sUrl
57136>>>>>                    End
57136>>>>>>
57136>>>>>                    Else Begin
57137>>>>>                        Get peBrowserTarget to eBrowserTarget
57138>>>>>                        Send NavigateToPage sUrl eBrowserTarget
57139>>>>>                    End
57139>>>>>>
57139>>>>>                End
57139>>>>>>
57139>>>>>            End
57139>>>>>>
57139>>>>>            Else Begin
57140>>>>>                Error DFERR_FILE_NOT_FOUND sFile
57141>>>>>>
57141>>>>>            End
57141>>>>>>
57141>>>>>        End
57141>>>>>>
57141>>>>>    End_Procedure
