58180>>>>>            Get psReportId to sReportId
58181>>>>>        End
58181>>>>>>
58181>>>>>
58181>>>>>        If (sReportId <> "") Begin
58183>>>>>            Get IsComObjectCreated to bComObjectCreated
58184>>>>>            If (bComObjectCreated) Begin
58186>>>>>                Get ComPageLayerCount sReportId to iPageLayers
58187>>>>>            End
58187>>>>>>
58187>>>>>            Else Begin
