58200>>>>>        End
58200>>>>>>
58200>>>>>
58200>>>>>        If (sReportId <> "") Begin
58202>>>>>            Get ComPageLayerCount sReportId to iPageLayerCount
58203>>>>>            If (iPageLayer < 0 or iPageLayer > iPageLayerCount) Begin
58205>>>>>                Error DFERR_DATAFLEX_REPORTS (SFormat (C_$DRInvalidPageLayerNumberPassed, iPageLayer))
58206>>>>>>
58206>>>>>            End
58206>>>>>>
58206>>>>>            Else Begin
58207>>>>>                Get IsComObjectCreated to bComObjectCreated
