58390>>>>>                Get ComParameterComment sReportId iParameter to ParameterInfo.sComments
58391>>>>>                Case Begin
58391>>>>>                    Case (ParameterInfo.iType = SQL_INTEGER)
58393>>>>>                        Move 10 to ParameterInfo.iLength
58394>>>>>                        Case Break
58395>>>>>                    Case (ParameterInfo.iType = SQL_DATETIME)
58398>>>>>                        Move 23 to ParameterInfo.iLength
58399>>>>>                        Case Break
