58414>>>>>                        Move 10 to ParameterInfo.iLength
58415>>>>>                        Case Break
58416>>>>>                    Case (ParameterInfo.iType = SQL_NUMERIC)
58419>>>>>                    Case (ParameterInfo.iType = SQL_DECIMAL)
58422>>>>>                    Case (ParameterInfo.iType = SQL_DOUBLE)
58425>>>>>                        Get ComParameterLength sReportId iParameter to ParameterInfo.iLength
58426>>>>>                        Get ComParameterPrecision sReportId iParameter to ParameterInfo.iPrecision
58427>>>>>                        Case Break
58428>>>>>                    Case Else
58428>>>>>                        Get ComParameterLength sReportId iParameter to ParameterInfo.iLength
58429>>>>>                        Case Break
58430>>>>>                Case End
58430>>>>>            End
58430>>>>>>
58430>>>>>        End
58430>>>>>>
58430>>>>>
58430>>>>>        Send RedirectErrorsToLocalHandler False
58431>>>>>
