59436>>>>>            Get IsComObjectCreated to bComObjectCreated
59437>>>>>            If (bComObjectCreated) Begin
59439>>>>>                Get ComTableCount sReportId to iTables
59440>>>>>                If (iTables > 0) Begin
59442>>>>>                    Decrement iTables
59443>>>>>                    Move (Uppercase (sTableName)) to sTableName
59444>>>>>                    For iTable from 0 to iTables
59450>>>>>>
59450>>>>>                        Get ComTableNameAlias sReportId iTable to sReportTableName
59451>>>>>                        If (Uppercase (sReportTableName) = sTableName) Begin
59453>>>>>                            Send RedirectErrorsToLocalHandler False
