59532>>>>>                Get SubReportCount sReportId to iSubReports
59533>>>>>                If (iSubReports > 0) Begin
59535>>>>>                    Decrement iSubReports
59536>>>>>                    For iSubReport from 0 to iSubReports
59542>>>>>>
59542>>>>>                        Get SubReportId sReportId iSubReport to sSubReportId
59543>>>>>                        Get TotalParameterCount sSubReportId to iSubReportParameterCount
59544>>>>>                        Move (iSubReportParameterCount + iParameterCount) to iParameterCount
59545>>>>>                    Loop
59546>>>>>>
59546>>>>>                End
59546>>>>>>
59546>>>>>            End
59546>>>>>>
59546>>>>>        End
59546>>>>>>
59546>>>>>
