61950>>>
61950>>>// This example webview is the second part of the customerlist report. The component contains the report object, which
61950>>>// will be invoked from the cWebDRReportViewer class to produce a HTML "stream". The returned String array contains all 
61950>>>// pages of the report. The javascript counterpart (previewer.js) shows the result and the user can navigate thru the pages. 
61950>>>// The cWebDRReportViewer control allows printing of the report thru the browser and via the action menu the user can select 
61950>>>// to export the report to one of the supported formats. 
61950>>>// Note that for this the report and the data will be reloaded, reformatted. Theoretically the results can be different 
61950>>>// due to changed data in the database.
61950>>>
61950>>>// Note that the report definition of "customerlist.dr" is different from the report definition of "Customer List.dr" in
61950>>>// the Windows order entry example.
61950>>>
61950>>>Object oCustomerListReportResults is a cWebView
61952>>>    Set psCaption to "CustomerList (Results)"
61953>>>    Set pbShowCaption to False
61954>>>    Set peViewType to vtZoom
61955>>>    Set peWebViewStyle to wvsDrillDown
61956>>>    Set peStateMode to vsmOff
