62188>>>            WebGet pasBrowserLanguages of ghoWebApp to sBrowserLanguages
62189>>>            If (SizeOfArray (sBrowserLanguages) > 0) Begin
62191>>>                Send SetReportLocaleAndLanguage sReportId sBrowserLanguages[0] 'ReportLanguage'
62192>>>            End
62192>>>>
62192>>>        End_Procedure
62193>>>
62193>>>        Procedure SetFilters String sReportId
