62490>>>// This example webview is the first part of the Sales per Salesperson per USA state crosstab report. A crosstab
62490>>>// report can have totals per row and/or totals per column and if both are present a grandtotal value. Via the
62490>>>// webcontrols on this webview the user can decide to show the totals row/column and grandtotal. The user can
62490>>>// also indicate to show a chart in the report results. While the chart could be integrated in the same report,
62490>>>// the demo does not do this, just to show how to dynamically load a different report. Finally the user can select
62490>>>// if all sales data should be used or only from the active or not active customers.
62490>>>
62490>>>// Grandtotal checkbox can only be checked if the crosstab shows a total row and total column.
