63125>>>// This example webview is the second part of the Orders Age report. The component contains the report object, which
63125>>>// will be invoked from the cWebDRReportViewer class to produce a HTML "stream". The returned String array contains 
63125>>>// all pages of the report. The javascript counterpart (previewer.js) shows the result and the user can navigate thru 
63125>>>// the pages. The cWebDRReportViewer control allows printing of the report thru the browser and via the action menu 
63125>>>// the user can select to export the report to one of the supported formats. 
63125>>>// Note that for this the report and the data will be reloaded, reformatted. Theoretically the results can be different 
63125>>>// due to changed data in the database.
63125>>>
