63232>>>// This example webview shows the results of the Salesperson Overview report. The report is an RDS report with
63232>>>// a crosstab sub-report directly reading from the database tables. The RDS data-source has been selected to
63232>>>// demonstrate how you can load image data into an RDS record.
63232>>>
63232>>>// The code also shows how to make use of the 6.2/19.x and higher ConvertTableDataToJsonSampleData library function. This
63232>>>// function converts the variant[][] array into a uchar[] array that matches a tDataSourceRow struct. After
63232>>>// converting the data the information is written into a JSON file. This JSON file can be imported in the
63232>>>// DataFlex Reports Studio so that the report has more and better test data.
63232>>>
63232>>>// The user can express - via the checkbox - whether the report should show the crosstab information or not
63232>>>
63232>>>// This webview is special as its layout changes greatly on the used device and its orientation mode. Check the OnResizeWindow
63232>>>// event comments for more information
63232>>>
63232>>>// While the user can choose a different sort order it makes not much difference as names and code are related to eachother
63232>>>// Changing the sort direction makes a difference
63232>>>
63232>>>Object oSalespersonOverviewReport is a cWebView
63234>>>    Object oSalesPerson_DD is a cSalesPersonDataDictionary
63236>>>    End_Object
63237>>>
63237>>>    Object oOrderHeader_DD is a cOrderHeaderDataDictionary
63239>>>        Set DDO_Server to oSalesPerson_DD
63240>>>        Set Constrain_File to SalesPerson.File_Number
63241>>>    End_Object
63242>>>
63242>>>    Set Main_DD to oSalesPerson_DD
63243>>>    Set Server to oSalesPerson_DD
63244>>>
63244>>>    Set psCaption to "Salesperson Overview"
63245>>>    Set pbShowCaption to False
63246>>>    Set peViewType to vtUndefined
63247>>>    Set peWebViewStyle to wvsDrillDown
63248>>>    Set pbServerOnResizeWindow to True
63249>>>    Set psStateViewName to "SalespersonOverviewReportSelect"
63250>>>
63250>>>    Object oReport is a cDRReport
63252>>>        Set psReportName to "Salesperson Overview.dr"
63253>>>
63253>>>        Procedure OnCreate
63256>>>            Forward Send OnCreate
63258>>>
63258>>>            Set piReportLanguage '' to LANG_DEFAULT
63259>>>        End_Procedure
63260>>>
63260>>>        Procedure OnInitializeReport
63263>>>            Send SetSortFields
63264>>>            Send SetParameters
63265>>>            Send CollectData
63266>>>        End_Procedure
63267>>>
63267>>>        // Via the parameter SalesOverview the report can show a crosstab per salesperson. The option to control
63267>>>        // this parameter comes from a different checkbox when the view runs on a mobile device in portrait mode
63267>>>        // then when it does not run in that mode
63267>>>        Procedure SetParameters
63270>>>            String sReportId
63270>>>            Boolean bShow
63270>>>            Integer iParameter eMode
63270>>>
63270>>>            WebGet peMode of ghoWebApp to eMode
63271>>>            If (eMode = rmMobilePortrait) Begin
63273>>>                Get GetChecked of oMobileDeviceShowSalesPerState to bShow
63274>>>            End
63274>>>>
63274>>>            Else Begin
63275>>>                Get GetChecked of oMainPanelShowSalesPerState to bShow
63276>>>            End
63276>>>>
63276>>>
63276>>>            Get psReportId to sReportId
63277>>>            Get ParameterIdByName sReportId "SalesOverview" to iParameter
63278>>>            Set psParameterValue sReportId iParameter to bShow
63279>>>        End_Procedure
63280>>>
63280>>>        // The sort order choice comes from the UI but the comboform is either placed in a cWebGroup or in a cWebAccordionCard
63280>>>        // depending on the device and its orientation
63280>>>        Procedure SetSortFields
63283>>>            String sReportId sSortField
63283>>>            Boolean bDescending
63283>>>            Integer eMode
63283>>>
63283>>>            Get psReportId to sReportId
63284>>>
63284>>>            WebGet peMode of ghoWebApp to eMode
63285>>>            If (eMode = rmMobilePortrait) Begin
63287>>>                Get GetChecked of oMobileDeviceSortDescending to bDescending
63288>>>                WebGet psValue of oMobileDeviceSortOnCombo to sSortField
63289>>>            End
63289>>>>
63289>>>            Else Begin
63290>>>                Get GetChecked of oMainPanelSortDescending to bDescending
63291>>>                WebGet psValue of oMainPanelSortOnCombo to sSortField
63292>>>            End
63292>>>>
63292>>>
63292>>>            Send RemoveAllRecordSortFields sReportId
63293>>>
63293>>>            If (bDescending) Begin
63295>>>                Send AddRecordSortField sReportId sSortField C_drDescending
63296>>>            End
63296>>>>
63296>>>            Else Begin
63297>>>                Send AddRecordSortField sReportId sSortField C_drAscending
63298>>>            End
63298>>>>
63298>>>        End_Procedure
63299>>>
63299>>>        // Read all salesperson data from the salesperson table via the DDO and add ID, NAME and Avatar file contents
63299>>>        // to the RDS array.
63299>>>        Procedure CollectData
63302>>>            String sReportId sPath sFileName
63302>>>            Variant[][] vData
63303>>>            Integer iRow iChannel iLength iResult
63303>>>            UChar[] ucFileData
63304>>>            Address aFileData
63304>>>            Boolean bGenerateTestData
63304>>>
63304>>>            Move 0 to iRow
63305>>>
63305>>>            Move (Seq_New_Channel ()) to iChannel
63306>>>            If (iChannel >= 0) Begin
63308>>>                Register_Object oZoomSalesPerson
63308>>>                Get SalesAvatarsFolder of oZoomSalesPerson to sPath
63309>>>
63309>>>                Send Request_Read of oSalesPerson_DD FIRST_RECORD (RefTable (SalesPerson)) 1
63310>>>                While (Found)
63314>>>                    Move (Trim (SalesPerson.ID)) to vData[iRow][0]
63315>>>                    Move (Trim (SalesPerson.Name)) to vData[iRow][1]
63316>>>
63316>>>                    // Construct the full name (path + filename) of the image file
63316>>>                    If (Trim (SalesPerson.Avatar) <> "") Begin
63318>>>                        Move (sPath + "\" + Trim (SalesPerson.Avatar)) to sFileName
63319>>>                    End
63319>>>>
63319>>>                    Else Begin
63320>>>                        Move (sPath + "\NONE.jpg") to sFileName
63321>>>                    End
63321>>>>
63321>>>
63321>>>                    // Read the image file contents into a UChar array
63321>>>                    Direct_Input channel iChannel ("BINARY:" - sFileName)
63323>>>                    Read_Block channel iChannel ucFileData -1
63325>>>                    Close_Input channel iChannel
63327>>>
63327>>>                    Move (Base64Encode (AddressOf (ucFileData), SizeOfArray (ucFileData))) to aFileData
63328>>>                    Move (CStringLength (aFileData)) to iLength
63329>>>                    Move (ResizeArray (ucFileData, iLength, 0)) to ucFileData
63330>>>                    Move (MemCopy (AddressOf (ucFileData), aFileData, iLength)) to iResult
63331>>>                    Move (UCharArrayToString (ucFileData, SizeOfArray (ucFileData))) to vData[iRow][2]
63332>>>                    Move (Free (aFileData)) to iResult
63333>>>
63333>>>                    Send Clear of oOrderHeader_DD
63334>>>                    Fill_Field (Reftable (OrderHeader)) (RefTable (OrderHeader.Order_Number)) With DF_HIGH
63336>>>                    Send Request_Read of oOrderHeader_DD FIRST_RECORD (RefTable (OrderHeader)) 4
63337>>>                    Move OrderHeader.Order_Number to vData[iRow][3]
63338>>>
63338>>>                    // Find the next salesperson
63338>>>                    Send Locate_Next of oSalesPerson_DD
63339>>>                    Increment iRow
63340>>>                Loop
63341>>>>
63341>>>
63341>>>                Get GetChecked of oGenerateTestData to bGenerateTestData
63342>>>                If (bGenerateTestData) Begin
63344>>>                    // Convert the vData array to a uChar array and export to disk. This makes it possible to read
63344>>>                    // the file as testdata during report design
63344>>>                    Get ConvertTableDataToJsonSampleData vData to ucFileData
63345>>>                    Get ReportsCacheFolder to sPath
63346>>>                    Move (sPath - "SalesPersonSampleData.json") to sFileName
63347>>>                    Direct_Output channel iChannel sFileName
63349>>>                    Write channel iChannel ucFileData
63351>>>                    Close_Output channel iChannel
63353>>>                End
63353>>>>
63353>>>
63353>>>                Send Seq_Release_Channel iChannel
63354>>>            End
63354>>>>
63354>>>
63354>>>            Get psReportId to sReportId
63355>>>            Send TableData sReportId 0 vData
63356>>>        End_Procedure
63357>>>    End_Object
63358>>>
