64069>>>// This cWebview component is the second step of the orders report that shows the usage of pagelayers. The use of pagelayers
64069>>>// makes it possible to replace pre-printed forms or simulate the pre-printed form to position and size the objects to print.
64069>>>
64069>>>// The component contains the report Object, which will be invoked from the cWebDRReportViewer class to produce a HTML
64069>>>// "stream". The returned String array contains all pages of the report. The javascript counterpart (previewer.js)
64069>>>// shows the result and the user can navigate thru the pages. The cWebDRReportViewer control allows printing of the report 
64069>>>// thru the browser and via the action menu the user can select to export the report to one of the supported formats. 
64069>>>// Note that for this the report and the data will be reloaded, reformatted. Theoretically the results can be different 
64069>>>// due to changed data in the database.
64069>>>
64069>>>// The "Orders with Pagelayers.dr" does not use only one pagelayer but uses multiple ones. The pagelayer information used
64069>>>// is included in the .dr file. There is a pagelayer with DAW paper and a Acme Inc paper. The order layout is available with
64069>>>// and without an "approved" stamp. Finally there are pagelayers for English and Dutch text boxes to allow multi language
64069>>>// order prints.
64069>>>
64069>>>Object oOrderswithPagelayersReportResults is a cWebView
64071>>>    Set psCaption to "Orders with Pagelayers (Results)"
64072>>>    Set pbShowCaption to False
64073>>>    Set peViewType to vtZoom
64074>>>    Set peWebViewStyle to wvsDrillDown
64075>>>    Set peStateMode to vsmOff
64076>>>    Set psStateViewName to "OrderswithPagelayersReportResults"
64077>>>
64077>>>    Object oReport is a cDRReport
64079>>>        Set psReportName to "Orders with Pagelayers.dr"
64080>>>
64080>>>        Procedure OnInitializeReport
64083>>>            Send SetFilters
64084>>>            Send SetSortFields
64085>>>            Send SetParameters
64086>>>        End_Procedure
64087>>>
64087>>>        // In this routine we find the code that sets the parameter values. The values
64087>>>        // for the parameters can be retrieved from an input control or from own coding.
64087>>>        Procedure SetParameters
64090>>>            String sReportId sValue sPath
64090>>>            Integer iParameter
64090>>>            tWebNavigateData NavigateData
64090>>>            tWebNavigateData NavigateData
64090>>>
64090>>>            Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
64091>>>
64091>>>            Get psReportId to sReportId
64092>>>
64092>>>            Get NamedValueGet NavigateData.NamedValues "CorporateLogoNum" to sValue
64093>>>
64093>>>            Get ParameterIdByName sReportId "HidePageLayers" to iParameter
64094>>>            Set psParameterValue sReportId iParameter to (sValue = "3")
64095>>>            If (sValue <> "3") Begin
64097>>>                Get ParameterIdByName sReportId "CorporateLogoNum" to iParameter
64098>>>                Set psParameterValue sReportId iParameter to sValue
64099>>>            End
64099>>>>
64099>>>
64099>>>            Get NamedValueGet NavigateData.NamedValues "PageLayerNum" to sValue
64100>>>            Get ParameterIdByName sReportId "PageLayerNum" to iParameter
64101>>>            Set psParameterValue sReportId iParameter to sValue
64102>>>
64102>>>            Get NamedValueGet NavigateData.NamedValues "Language" to sValue
64103>>>            Get ParameterIdByName sReportId "Language" to iParameter
64104>>>            Set psParameterValue sReportId iParameter to sValue
64105>>>
64105>>>            Case Begin
64105>>>                Case (sValue = 'NL')
64107>>>                    Set piReportLanguage '' to LANG_DUTCH
64108>>>                    Case Break
64109>>>                Case Else
64109>>>                    Set piReportLanguage '' to LANG_DEFAULT
64110>>>                    Case Break
64111>>>            Case End
64111>>>
64111>>>            Get_File_Path "CodeMast.dat" to sPath
64112>>>            Move (ExtractFilePath (sPath)) to sPath
64113>>>            Get ParameterIdByName sReportId "CodeMastPath" to iParameter
64114>>>            Set psParameterValue sReportId iParameter to sPath
64115>>>        End_Procedure
64116>>>
64116>>>        Procedure SetSortFields
64119>>>            tWebNavigateData NavigateData
64119>>>            tWebNavigateData NavigateData
64119>>>            String sReportId sSortField
64119>>>            Integer iSortDirection
64119>>>
64119>>>            Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
64120>>>            Get psReportId to sReportId
64121>>>
64121>>>            Send RemoveAllRecordSortFields sReportId
64122>>>            Get NamedValueGet NavigateData.NamedValues "SortDirection" to iSortDirection
64123>>>            Get NamedValueGet NavigateData.NamedValues "SortField" to sSortField
64124>>>            Send AddRecordSortField sReportId sSortField iSortDirection
64125>>>        End_Procedure
64126>>>
64126>>>        Procedure SetFilters
64129>>>            String sReportId
64129>>>            tWebNavigateData NavigateData
64129>>>            tWebNavigateData NavigateData
64129>>>            Integer iValueIndex iModeIndex
64129>>>
64129>>>            Get psReportId to sReportId
64130>>>            Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
64131>>>
64131>>>            // Remove all the defined filters from the report
64131>>>            Send RemoveAllFilters sReportId
64132>>>            Get NamedValueIndex NavigateData.NamedValues "OrderHeaderOrderNumber" to iValueIndex
64133>>>            Get NamedValueIndex NavigateData.NamedValues "OrderHeaderOrderNumberMode" to iModeIndex
64134>>>
64134>>>            If (iModeIndex > -1 and iValueIndex > -1) Begin
64136>>>                Send AddFilter sReportId "{OrderHeader.Order_Number}" NavigateData.NamedValues[iModeIndex].sValue NavigateData.NamedValues[iValueIndex].sValue
64137>>>            End
64137>>>>
64137>>>
64137>>>            Get NamedValueIndex NavigateData.NamedValues "OrderHeaderCustomerNumber" to iValueIndex
64138>>>            Get NamedValueIndex NavigateData.NamedValues "OrderHeaderCustomerNumberMode" to iModeIndex
64139>>>
64139>>>            If (iModeIndex > -1 and iValueIndex > -1) Begin
64141>>>                Send AddFilter sReportId "{OrderHeader.Customer_Number}" NavigateData.NamedValues[iModeIndex].sValue NavigateData.NamedValues[iValueIndex].sValue
64142>>>            End
64142>>>>
64142>>>        End_Procedure
64143>>>    End_Object
