64207>>>// This example webview is the first part of the Top N Salespersons report.
64207>>>
64207>>>// Users can specify the value of N for the group sort operation. Choices are top 3, 4 or 10. Technically other numbers
64207>>>// can be used as well but this demo limits to these three values
64207>>>
64207>>>// The results are shown in a second webview. This is done to give the maximum space for the results in a webview.
64207>>>
64207>>>// The user can indicate if the report should show a chart representing the results and/or a line that tells what the
64207>>>// other salespersons were selling.
64207>>>
