64454>>>                Move Inventory.Description to vData[iLabel][1]
64455>>>                Move Inventory.Unit_Price to vData[iLabel][2]
64456>>>            Loop
64457>>>>
64457>>>
64457>>>            Send TableData sReportId 0 vData
